Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.92,0:02:51.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother, what are you...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.29,0:02:53.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a burglar.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.66,0:02:55.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to scare you, darling,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.99,0:02:57.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was just getting a snack.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.81,0:02:58.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go back to bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.62,0:03:01.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.68,0:03:03.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go on, back to bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.67,0:03:08.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll make you hot chocolate.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.42,0:03:10.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.32,0:03:16.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,And what have you done with my mother?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.32,0:03:20.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,My mother has never set foot in this kitchen in her life.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.12,0:03:24.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,And she certainly wouldn't get me hot chocolate.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.61,0:03:27.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unless she kept ordering me to do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.45,0:03:48.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not scared of me?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.80,0:03:51.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,I always believed I couldn't be the only one in the world.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.64,0:03:54.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,The only person who is...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.13,0:03:56.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,...different.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.86,0:04:01.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,And here you are, Charles Xavier.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.43,0:04:05.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Raven.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.05,0:04:08.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're hungry, and alone?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.21,0:04:10.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take whatever you want.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.73,0:04:12.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've got lots of food, you don't have to steal.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.54,0:04:15.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,In fact...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.14,0:04:19.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,...you never have to steal again.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.39,0:04:36.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Understand this, Erik.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.72,0:04:41.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,These Nazi's, I'm not like them.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.04,0:04:46.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Genes are the key, yes...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.28,0:04:49.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,But their goals?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.30,0:04:53.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Blue eyes, Blond hair, Pathetic.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.43,0:05:01.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Eat the chocolate.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.27,0:05:03.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.02,0:05:05.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Want some?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.41,0:05:09.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want to see my Mama.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.92,0:05:21.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Genes are the keys that unlocks the door to a new age, Erik.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.28,0:05:25.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,A new future for mankind.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.08,0:05:27.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Evolution.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.98,0:05:31.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what I'm talking about?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.47,0:05:35.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a simple thing I ask of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.20,0:05:41.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,A little coin is nothing compared to a big gate.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.56,0:05:43.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.82,0:06:00.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,I tried, Herr Doctor...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.83,0:06:04.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't... I don't...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.36,0:06:07.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.38,0:06:12.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,The one thing I can say for the Nazi's,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.92,0:06:15.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,is their methods seem to produce results.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.77,0:06:19.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Erik.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.28,0:06:31.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.51,0:06:33.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,My darling.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.80,0:06:36.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.94,0:06:41.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here's what we're going to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.60,0:06:45.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going to count to three...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.91,0:06:48.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,...and you're going to move the coin.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.48,0:06:54.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't move the coin, I pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.27,0:06:57.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.38,0:07:00.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,One...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.93,0:07:04.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Mama! - You can do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.29,0:07:10.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.24,0:07:14.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything is all right.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.92,0:07:26.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything is all right.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.64,0:07:30.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything is all right!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.83,0:07:32.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.23,0:07:55.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, wonderful!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.24,0:08:06.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.71,0:08:52.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Outstanding, Erik!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.90,0:08:57.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,So we unlock you're gift with anger.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.82,0:09:02.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anger and pain.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.30,0:09:09.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,You and me, we're going to have a lot of fun together.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.74,0:10:25.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hetero-chromia.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.27,0:10:29.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,A gentlemen would at least offer to buy me a drink first.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.58,0:10:32.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Newman, a pint of bitter for me
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.52,0:10:33.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,and a brandy for the lady, please.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.57,0:10:36.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How did you know that? - Lucky guess.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.29,0:10:38.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,The name's, Xavier, Charles Xavier.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.21,0:10:39.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How do you do... - Amy.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.58,0:10:41.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heterochromia, is reference to your eyes,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.65,0:10:43.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,which I have to say are stunning.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.06,0:10:46.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,One green, one blue. It's a mutation.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.72,0:10:48.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a very groovy mutation.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.28,0:10:51.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have news for you, Amy. You are a mutant.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.57,0:10:52.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,First you proposition a girl,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.95,0:10:54.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,and then you call her deformed.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.13,0:10:57.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,How is that seduction tactic working for you?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.44,0:10:58.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you in the morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.75,0:10:59.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.71,0:11:01.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Seriously, you must knock it.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.47,0:11:02.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mutation's go from single cell organisms
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.64,0:11:05.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,to being the dominate form of reproductive life.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.16,0:11:07.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,On this planet,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.30,0:11:10.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,infinite forms of variations with each generation
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.26,0:11:13.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,all through mutation.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.36,0:11:15.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then let's reclaim that word.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.40,0:11:22.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Mutant, and proud. - Chin, chin, hey.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.74,0:11:24.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi, I guess I have to buy my own drink.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.47,0:11:25.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, one cola.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.82,0:11:26.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Charles here was just telling me
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.10,0:11:28.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,that I'm like one of the first sea creatures...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.40,0:11:29.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,that grew legs.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.66,0:11:30.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tiny bit sexier.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.57,0:11:33.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, this is my sister, Raven.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.63,0:11:37.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hi, Amy. - And what do you study?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.66,0:11:39.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Waitressing.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.98,0:11:44.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh look, you have hetero-chromia too!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.83,0:11:47.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Say, what? - Look at her eye...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.52,0:11:52.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right, Raven get your coat please.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.51,0:11:55.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me, you did that on purpose.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.40,0:11:56.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I did not! - Yes you did!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.86,0:11:57.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why would I do it on purpose?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.81,0:11:59.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know I can't control it sometimes.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.22,0:12:00.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,When I'm stressed or tired..
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.40,0:12:02.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,You seem to be doing a perfectly good job right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.00,0:12:04.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Mutant and proud"
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.69,0:12:06.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why is it always the pretty mutations,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.62,0:12:08.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,or the invisible ones like yours.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.41,0:12:09.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you're a freak, better hide.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.13,0:12:12.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're being ridiculous!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.28,0:12:14.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't mean to sound like an old fart.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.64,0:12:15.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Which you are.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.80,0:12:18.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, but we've talked about this, Raven.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.67,0:12:21.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,A small slip up is one thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.19,0:12:23.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,A big one does not bear thinking about.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.25,0:12:31.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Mutant and proud"
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.04,0:12:35.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Mutant and proud"?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.06,0:12:47.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,If only...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.42,0:12:56.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Would you date me? - Of course I would.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.09,0:12:58.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Any man would be lucky to have you.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.90,0:13:01.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're stunning! - Looking like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.41,0:13:02.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like, you...what?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.04,0:13:07.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Blue?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.61,0:13:13.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're my oldest friend. - I'm your only friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.77,0:13:14.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you for that.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.85,0:13:16.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.95,0:13:18.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm incapable of even thinking of you like that,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.30,0:13:20.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I feel responsible for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.96,0:13:23.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anything else would just feel wrong.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.24,0:13:25.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,But what if you didn't know me?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.37,0:13:26.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately I do know you.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.02,0:13:28.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's got into you lately?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.57,0:13:30.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're awfully concerned with your looks.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.02,0:13:36.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sleepy. Will you read to me?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.78,0:13:39.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't, I have my thesis coming up, I have to study.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.23,0:13:40.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well fine, read about your thesis
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.45,0:13:41.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,it always sends me right off.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.41,0:13:46.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,To Homo neanderthalensis, his mutant cousin Homo sapiens,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.53,0:13:47.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,was an aberration.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.32,0:13:50.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Peaceful co-habitation, if ever it existed,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.20,0:13:52.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,was short lived.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.73,0:13:54.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Records show, without exception
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.56,0:13:56.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,that the arrival of the mutated human species
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.81,0:13:58.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,in any region was followed by
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.38,0:14:01.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,the immediate extinction of their less evolved kin.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.30,0:14:11.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Possession of that gold is illegal.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.80,0:14:15.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I should inform the police. - Let's not play this game.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.80,0:14:19.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where did you get it? - A Friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.66,0:14:23.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,He recommended your bank, most highly.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.00,0:14:25.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.36,0:14:27.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you know our terms, sir?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.09,0:14:29.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.77,0:14:32.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you should know mine.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.56,0:14:38.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,This gold is what remains of my people.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.50,0:14:42.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melted from their possessions. Torn from their teeth.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.03,0:14:45.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is blood money.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.40,0:14:46.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you're going to help me find
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.70,0:14:49.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,the bastards responsible for it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.85,0:14:55.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't touch that alarm.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.06,0:15:02.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want Schmidt, Klaus Schmidt.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.48,0:15:03.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.52,0:15:06.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our clients don't supply addresses, we're not...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.67,0:15:08.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not that sort of bank?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.37,0:15:18.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Metal fillings, eh, not gold.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.90,0:15:20.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Worried someone might steal them?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.93,0:15:24.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Argentina! Schmidt is in Argentina!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.33,0:15:28.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Villa Gesell! Please, please!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.05,0:15:45.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.69,0:15:53.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,I would love to kill you.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.16,0:16:02.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,So mark my words, if you warn anyone, I'm coming...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.04,0:16:05.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,...I will find you.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.48,0:16:19.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Another day at the office.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.87,0:16:22.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that Colonel Hendry?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.76,0:16:24.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The NATO guy? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.24,0:16:27.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.82,0:16:29.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cause that's three mob bosses,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.52,0:16:32.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,the Italian ambassador, the CEO of Lockheed.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.64,0:16:34.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,They can't all be communists.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.46,0:16:36.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,This Hellfire club's gotta be something else.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.39,0:16:42.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you see that? Hello, girls!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.29,0:16:45.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow, very nice.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.82,0:16:48.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wha...what are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.33,0:16:50.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here's things that the CIA didn't give me.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.19,0:16:52.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay put.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.47,0:16:57.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Colonel Hendry? - Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.54,0:17:00.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Emma Frost, Sebastian Shaw's associate.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.99,0:17:03.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,And where is, Mr. Shaw?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.90,0:17:07.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're having a party, and here's the entertainment.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.20,0:17:08.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.61,0:17:48.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello beautiful, how are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.22,0:17:51.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey baby, you want to find a quiet place?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.86,0:17:54.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry. I've been booked by Colonel Hendry.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.33,0:17:58.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.28,0:18:22.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you sure we can't get a refill, Bob? - No.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.08,0:18:24.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, I hear you blocked
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.69,0:18:27.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,the proposal to position Jupiter missiles in Turkey.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.23,0:18:32.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,I expect you to reconsider.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.07,0:18:34.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've had this conversation.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.47,0:18:35.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,You put our nukes in Turkey,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.88,0:18:38.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,or anywhere that close to Russia,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.42,0:18:41.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,and you're looking at war. Nuclear war.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.86,0:19:16.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask for favors, Colonel.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.62,0:19:18.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,I express my expectations.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.22,0:19:21.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, let me say it again.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.40,0:19:25.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I expect you'll reconsider.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.56,0:19:28.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,The only thing I will reconsider,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.09,0:19:32.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,is having another glass of that delicious champagne.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.71,0:19:47.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you put in my drink?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.53,0:20:07.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're thinking of running, hiding?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.68,0:20:09.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'd find you, Hendry.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.38,0:20:12.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's not a fortress in the world that can keep us out.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.07,0:20:32.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Magnificent, isn't she, Bob?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.13,0:20:37.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Genetic mutation, the evolution of the human genome.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.45,0:20:39.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's Azazel?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.53,0:20:47.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah, we don't want the Colonel to be late.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.63,0:20:52.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.61,0:20:58.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Missiles in Turkey send a very clear message.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.46,0:20:59.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,We ever decided to fire them,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.67,0:21:00.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,the Russians early warning system
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.81,0:21:02.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,won't even have time to kick in.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.37,0:21:03.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,This better be important, MacTaggert
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.17,0:21:05.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, slow down.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.54,0:21:07.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,You smoking them funny cigarettes?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.55,0:21:08.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,People don't disappear.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.11,0:21:10.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Colonel Hendry was there.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.49,0:21:12.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,He was there, McCone, in the Hellfire club.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.58,0:21:13.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Colonel Hendry?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.81,0:21:17.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I agree with you, General. I've reconsidered my position.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.64,0:21:20.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I now believe that we should put Jupiter Missiles in Turkey.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.31,0:21:22.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Colonel Hendry is here.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.45,0:21:23.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, unless he magically traveled
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.80,0:21:25.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,3,000 miles in the last ten minutes,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.83,0:21:29.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, I suggest that you stop wasting my time.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.34,0:21:31.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks like Hendry wants to start World War III.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.70,0:21:33.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have better things to deal with right now, MacTaggert.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.24,0:21:35.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir, I...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.10,0:21:38.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.63,0:21:40.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, now what?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.28,0:21:44.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,We find an expert on Genetic Mutation.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.91,0:21:49.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Professor of genetics, Charles Francis Xavier.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.73,0:21:54.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, how does it feel to be a professor?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.09,0:21:56.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, ah, don't call me that.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.09,0:21:57.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't get to be called a Professor
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.39,0:21:58.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,until you actually have a teaching position.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.85,0:21:59.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know, but it suits you.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.08,0:22:01.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,No,  don't say that, do say "Lets go have a drink".
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.80,0:22:03.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let's go have a drink. - Wonderful!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.65,0:22:34.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Good evening, my friends! - Good evening!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.55,0:22:35.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hot, no? - Yes...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.09,0:22:37.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,One beer, please.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.50,0:23:03.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,- German beer? - Of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.09,0:23:07.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's Bitburger. You like it?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.00,0:23:15.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,The best.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.75,0:23:22.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,What brings you to Argentina?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.32,0:23:29.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,The climate, I'm a pig farmer.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:32.70,0:23:35.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tailor, since I was a boy.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.87,0:23:38.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,My father made the finest suits in Dusseldorf.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.45,0:23:41.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,My Parents were from, Dusseldorf.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:43.83,0:23:46.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What was their name? - They didn't have a name.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:48.57,0:23:50.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was taken away from them...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:50.93,0:23:52.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,...by pig farmers...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:53.62,0:23:54.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,...and tailors.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:24.18,0:24:25.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Blood and Honor".
Dialogue: 1,0:24:25.96,0:24:27.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Which would you care to shed first?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:28.02,0:24:31.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We were under orders. - Blood then.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:33.68,0:24:36.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Freeze, asshole! - Come on, shoot!
Dialogue: 1,0:24:57.05,0:24:59.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who, what are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:02.15,0:25:04.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's just say I'm Frankenstein's monster.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:16.97,0:25:18.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for my creator.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:23.64,0:25:28.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Drink, drink, drink!
Dialogue: 1,0:25:41.36,0:25:42.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh,  I'm so proud of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:43.91,0:25:46.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need another drink,and you need another cola
Dialogue: 1,0:25:51.11,0:25:52.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Congratulations, Professor! - Thank you very much,
Dialogue: 1,0:25:52.91,0:25:54.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,it's much harder than it looks, actually.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:54.49,0:25:55.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, on your presentation.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:55.81,0:25:56.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,You knew my presentation?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:57.07,0:25:58.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,How nice of you, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:58.54,0:25:59.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Moira MacTaggert.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:59.70,0:26:00.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Charles Xavier.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:00.58,0:26:01.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you have a minute?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:01.62,0:26:06.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,For a pretty little beam with a mutated MCR-1 gene,  I have five.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:06.74,0:26:11.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,I say, MCR-1, you would say, golden hair.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:11.58,0:26:14.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a mutation, it's a very groovy mutation.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:15.17,0:26:19.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mutation you know, took us from single cell organisms,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:19.67,0:26:21.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,to the dominate form...
Dialogue: 1,0:26:21.24,0:26:24.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what, this routine may go over great with the co-eds,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:24.11,0:26:25.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,but I'm here on business.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:25.77,0:26:26.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:27.01,0:26:28.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I really need your help.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:28.97,0:26:30.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:30.38,0:26:32.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,The kind that of mutations
Dialogue: 1,0:26:32.40,0:26:33.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,that you were talking about in your thesis
Dialogue: 1,0:26:33.94,0:26:36.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need to know if they may already have happened.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:37.64,0:26:38.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,In people alive today.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:51.21,0:26:51.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Professor?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:54.74,0:26:56.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think that we should just talk when you're sober.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:56.36,0:26:57.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you have any time tomorrow?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:59.21,0:27:00.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Something tells me,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:00.32,0:27:02.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,you already know the answer to your question.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:05.15,0:27:06.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is very important to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:06.34,0:27:08.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,And if I can help you, I will do my utmost.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:10.17,0:27:10.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:14.35,0:27:15.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Still drinking champagne, Bob?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:16.61,0:27:17.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will pass.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:18.77,0:27:21.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, well so much for the pleasantries.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:22.29,0:27:25.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was wondering, who you told about our little arrangement?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:26.06,0:27:26.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,No one.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:29.87,0:27:30.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:30.97,0:27:31.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:32.13,0:27:34.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well I guess we're done here.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:34.18,0:27:36.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's wrap things up, shall we?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:40.21,0:27:42.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well I knew better than to trust you.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:43.81,0:27:47.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now you let me walk out of here with my money.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:47.50,0:27:51.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or I will pull this pin and we all die.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:52.10,0:27:54.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, pull it.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:55.11,0:27:56.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll do it, I swear to god.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:06.60,0:28:07.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,No you won't.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:13.17,0:28:13.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I will.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:27.92,0:28:28.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're one of them?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:29.10,0:28:31.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Very astute of you, Colonel Hendry.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:31.22,0:28:32.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,You want to guess what I can do?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:33.06,0:28:34.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've got the power to absorb energy.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:34.37,0:28:36.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,It keeps me young.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:36.40,0:28:37.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the boring part.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:37.82,0:28:41.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,The fun stuff is what I can do with it once I got it.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:48.50,0:28:49.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,The advent of the nuclear age,
Dialogue: 1,0:28:49.44,0:28:51.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,may have accelerated the mutation process.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:51.81,0:28:56.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Individual's with extraordinary abilities may already be among us.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:57.34,0:28:58.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:58.38,0:28:59.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,MacTaggert, you really think that
Dialogue: 1,0:28:59.89,0:29:02.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,some crackpot scientist is going to make me believe in
Dialogue: 1,0:29:02.72,0:29:05.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,sparkly dames and vanishing men?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:05.11,0:29:06.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,You just brought yourself a one way
Dialogue: 1,0:29:06.53,0:29:07.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,ticket back to the typing pool.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:08.34,0:29:09.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,This meeting is over.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:09.45,0:29:12.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh, please sit down agent, MacTaggert.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:13.28,0:29:15.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't really expect you to believe me.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:15.33,0:29:16.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Given that all you could think about
Dialogue: 1,0:29:16.76,0:29:18.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,during my presentation, was what sort of pie
Dialogue: 1,0:29:18.50,0:29:20.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,they were serving in the commissary.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:21.01,0:29:22.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's apple pecan.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:23.15,0:29:25.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I haven't been entirely honest with you, and I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:25.52,0:29:30.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,You see, one of the many spectacular things my mutation allows me to do,
Dialogue: 1,0:29:30.07,0:29:32.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,is that I can read your mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:32.62,0:29:34.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've seen this before in a magic show.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:34.94,0:29:36.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you going to ask us to
Dialogue: 1,0:29:36.64,0:29:38.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,think of a number between one and ten now?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:39.06,0:29:39.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, agent Stryker.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:39.95,0:29:42.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Although I could ask you about your son William
Dialogue: 1,0:29:42.82,0:29:43.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,who you were thinking about,
Dialogue: 1,0:29:43.72,0:29:44.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,which is very nice.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:44.75,0:29:46.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I think I'd rather ask you about
Dialogue: 1,0:29:46.66,0:29:49.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,the Jupiter missiles America are currently placing in Turkey.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:51.72,0:29:52.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's a goddamn spy!
Dialogue: 1,0:29:52.82,0:29:54.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,You brought a goddamn spy!
Dialogue: 1,0:29:54.48,0:29:56.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,I did not, I would never bring one here!
Dialogue: 1,0:30:15.68,0:30:17.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,How's that for a magic trick?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:20.38,0:30:21.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Best I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:23.26,0:30:24.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want them out of here.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:25.29,0:30:27.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,And lock down until I can figure out what to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:29.14,0:30:32.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,My facility is off site. I'll take them.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:35.02,0:30:35.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:35.86,0:30:38.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'd think the director of the CIA would have a little more composure.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:38.04,0:30:39.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,We should be going after Shaw right now,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:39.52,0:30:41.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,but instead he's up there worrying about the wrong mutants.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:42.24,0:30:43.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are we doing to do, Lavene?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:44.13,0:30:47.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lavene? Lavene, what's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:49.29,0:30:50.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Absolutely nothing,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:50.62,0:30:53.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've just frozen him for the moment because I'd like to talk to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:53.11,0:30:54.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's good, isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:54.40,0:30:57.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm as interested in this Sebastian Shaw as you are,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:57.31,0:30:58.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,And if you still want my help,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:58.48,0:31:00.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,meet me on the third floor of the parking garage.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:01.53,0:31:04.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've always known that there were people like you out there.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:04.30,0:31:06.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been the laughing stock of this agency for years
Dialogue: 1,0:31:06.19,0:31:07.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,but I knew it.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:07.91,0:31:09.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're going to love my facility.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:09.15,0:31:10.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's going to have to wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:10.38,0:31:10.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:11.11,0:31:13.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Agent MacTaggert has to lead us to Sebastian Shaw,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:13.06,0:31:15.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,and if we don't move now apparently we're going to loose him.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:15.47,0:31:16.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:16.20,0:31:17.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not only can he read minds,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:17.67,0:31:19.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,he can communicate with them as well.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:19.50,0:31:21.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Moria and I have just had a lovely conversation.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:21.39,0:31:22.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, we did.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:22.69,0:31:23.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,That is incredible!
Dialogue: 1,0:31:25.10,0:31:26.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I cannot take you anywhere else,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:27.00,0:31:28.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,without permission from upstairs.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:28.36,0:31:29.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Would you like to see one more magic trick?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:29.72,0:31:30.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:30.29,0:31:31.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get in the car.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:31.09,0:31:31.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:53.33,0:31:54.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Herr Doctor.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:57.01,0:32:00.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Little Erik Lensherr.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:01.42,0:32:02.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's here to kill you.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:09.67,0:32:12.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,What kind of greeting is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:14.92,0:32:17.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,After all these years?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:26.32,0:32:27.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Emma.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:29.03,0:32:30.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,We don't harm our own kind.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:32.53,0:32:35.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah, now it's a party.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:36.17,0:32:38.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is the US Coast guard.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:38.13,0:32:40.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do not attempt to move your vessel.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:41.12,0:32:42.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay where you are.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:48.93,0:32:50.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,They have a telepath.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:53.87,0:32:55.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've lost, Shaw!
Dialogue: 1,0:32:56.20,0:32:57.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've lost, I've lost, Shaw.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:57.90,0:32:59.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's, there's something blocking me.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:59.80,0:33:00.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,This has never happened to me before.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:00.74,0:33:02.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think there's someone like me on that ship.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:02.90,0:33:03.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like you?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:03.92,0:33:05.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, a telepath.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:05.53,0:33:06.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is incredible,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:06.16,0:33:07.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can actually feel her inside my mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:07.92,0:33:08.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:08.53,0:33:10.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,but I don't think I'm going to be much help to you tonight.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:10.29,0:33:11.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're on your own.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:25.14,0:33:26.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh my god. - Jesus.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:30.14,0:33:31.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:37.18,0:33:38.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop, stop, stop!
Dialogue: 1,0:33:39.88,0:33:42.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Charles! You okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:42.45,0:33:43.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's someone else out there.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:48.03,0:33:48.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 1,0:33:52.32,0:33:53.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Time to go.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:48.12,0:34:49.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:51.77,0:34:53.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Better let it go!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:53.18,0:34:53.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've got help him...
Dialogue: 1,0:34:53.64,0:34:55.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,there's someone in the water, help him!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:55.04,0:34:58.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let it go! You have to let it go!
Dialogue: 1,0:35:18.39,0:35:21.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't, you'll drown. You have to let go.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:21.85,0:35:24.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know what this means to you but you're going to die.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:24.95,0:35:28.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please, Erik, calm your mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:40.37,0:35:42.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get off of me, get off!
Dialogue: 1,0:35:42.38,0:35:44.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Calm down, please. - We're here!
Dialogue: 1,0:35:44.89,0:35:45.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:45.62,0:35:47.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Professor Charles Xavier.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:47.60,0:35:48.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,You were in my head.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:49.01,0:35:49.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,How did you do that?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:50.45,0:35:52.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have your tricks, I have mine.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:52.00,0:35:54.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm like you, just calm your mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:56.80,0:36:00.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I thought I was alone. - You're not alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:02.08,0:36:05.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik, you're not alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:25.76,0:36:27.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my facility.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:28.32,0:36:30.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,My mission has been to investigate the application
Dialogue: 1,0:36:30.66,0:36:33.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,of paranormal powers for military defense.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:33.36,0:36:34.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or offense.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:35.08,0:36:37.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,This guy, Shaw, Schmidt,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:37.20,0:36:38.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,whatever you want to call him.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:38.43,0:36:39.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's working with the Russians.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:40.25,0:36:41.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,We might need your help to stop them.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:41.67,0:36:42.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marvelous.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:42.73,0:36:45.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,So we're to be the CIA's new mutant division, yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:36:46.73,0:36:47.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:51.64,0:36:55.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a supersonic. The most advanced plane ever built.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:57.08,0:36:58.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,You should see it in real life.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:58.86,0:37:00.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's incredible.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:00.15,0:37:04.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hank, these are the special new recruits I was telling you about.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:04.30,0:37:05.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is, Hank McCoy,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:05.33,0:37:07.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,one of our most talented young researchers.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:07.40,0:37:11.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,How wonderful, another mutant. Already here.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:11.07,0:37:12.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:12.95,0:37:14.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:15.57,0:37:16.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because you don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:17.79,0:37:20.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am so, so terribly sorry!
Dialogue: 1,0:37:23.90,0:37:24.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hank?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:25.00,0:37:26.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,You didn't ask, so I didn't tell.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:27.49,0:37:30.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,So your mutation's what? You're super smart?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:30.96,0:37:33.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll say, Hank here graduated honors
Dialogue: 1,0:37:33.03,0:37:34.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,at the age of fifteen.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:35.50,0:37:36.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wish that's all it was.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:37.33,0:37:39.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're among friends now, Hank.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:39.04,0:37:40.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,You could show off.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:57.03,0:37:58.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Splendid.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:04.48,0:38:06.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sorry. - Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:20.67,0:38:21.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're amazing.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:22.66,0:38:23.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:29.08,0:38:30.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,The presence of U.S. Missiles in Turkey
Dialogue: 1,0:38:30.79,0:38:34.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,represents an unprecedented threat to the people of the Soviet Union.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:34.42,0:38:37.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Warned Russian Mister Gromeko, earlier today
Dialogue: 1,0:38:38.22,0:38:39.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,But he was quick to insist
Dialogue: 1,0:38:39.70,0:38:43.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,the Russians would not be the first to initiate any military action.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:43.72,0:38:46.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll fix that as soon as we get to Russia.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:46.67,0:38:48.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unless the CIA finds us first.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:49.13,0:38:50.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of them too.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:52.56,0:38:54.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,If that telepath gets inside your head,
Dialogue: 1,0:38:55.06,0:38:56.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,he won't be as much fun as I am.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:57.49,0:38:58.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Already in hand, my love.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:09.18,0:39:13.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Russians made me this.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:17.89,0:39:20.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, what am I thinking?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:30.00,0:39:30.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:34.22,0:39:34.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was thinking that
Dialogue: 1,0:39:34.85,0:39:37.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,you are the  most exquisite thing that I've ever seen in my life.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:42.20,0:39:43.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,And that this needs ice.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:45.67,0:39:46.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fetch me some.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:47.49,0:39:48.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a good girl.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:14.57,0:40:16.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I, I promised myself I'd find a cure,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:16.77,0:40:18.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,ever since I was a little boy.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:18.69,0:40:22.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have no idea what I'd give to feel...
Dialogue: 1,0:40:22.72,0:40:23.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- normal. - Normal.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:29.07,0:40:30.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Charles has never understood.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:31.62,0:40:34.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's different, but he's never had to hide.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:35.71,0:40:37.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hank，this serum that you're making,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:37.43,0:40:39.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,it doesn't affect abilities, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:39.87,0:40:42.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just appearance. Normalizes it.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:43.03,0:40:43.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:44.74,0:40:46.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you think it would work on me?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:48.13,0:40:49.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can look into it, if you'd like.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:50.21,0:40:52.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the least I can do after asking
Dialogue: 1,0:40:52.03,0:40:53.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,you to come down here to listen to a weird request.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:54.12,0:40:54.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have to admit,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:54.97,0:40:57.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,usually when guys ask me out they're not after my blood.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:58.40,0:41:01.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,S..sorry, I didn't intend to be forward.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:01.46,0:41:03.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was just...I was excited.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:04.06,0:41:06.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, the nature of your mutation.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:06.39,0:41:09.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,If any genes hold the key to changing appearance, it's yours.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:09.98,0:41:11.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hank, you aren't being forward,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:11.87,0:41:14.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,that's kinda what I meant.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:14.67,0:41:18.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, but I'm just sorry if you thought I was.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:18.35,0:41:19.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I'm sorry that you weren't.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:21.59,0:41:23.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, take the blood.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:36.02,0:41:37.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry, did I hurt you?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:40.18,0:41:41.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kinky!
Dialogue: 1,0:41:43.64,0:41:44.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:45.10,0:41:48.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,if I looked like you, I wouldn't change a thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:16.76,0:42:17.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,What I know about you,
Dialogue: 1,0:42:17.53,0:42:19.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you managed to stay this long.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:21.60,0:42:24.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What do you know about me? - Everything.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:25.37,0:42:27.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then know to stay out of my head.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:27.38,0:42:28.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry Erik,
Dialogue: 1,0:42:28.53,0:42:30.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,but I've seen what Shaw did to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:32.63,0:42:34.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,I felt your agony.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:36.89,0:42:37.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can help you.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:45.70,0:42:46.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't need your help.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:46.95,0:42:49.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't kid yourself. You needed my help last night.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:49.40,0:42:51.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not just me you're walking away from.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:52.61,0:42:53.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here you have the chance
Dialogue: 1,0:42:53.62,0:42:56.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,to be a part of something much bigger than yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:59.01,0:43:00.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I won't stop you leaving,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:00.49,0:43:01.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,I could.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:05.33,0:43:06.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I won't.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:10.79,0:43:11.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shaw's got friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:12.89,0:43:14.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,You could do with some.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:20.66,0:43:23.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hank turned that radar installation into a transmitter.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:23.68,0:43:26.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's designed to amplify brain waves,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:26.26,0:43:28.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,so it could enhance your telepathic powers.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:28.80,0:43:30.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help us find other mutants for our division.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:30.90,0:43:32.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought they'd all been found by you.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:32.65,0:43:33.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik!
Dialogue: 1,0:43:35.10,0:43:36.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,You decided to stay.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:39.17,0:43:41.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,If a new species is being discovered,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:41.41,0:43:42.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,it should be by its own kind.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:43.33,0:43:45.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Charles and I find the new mutants, no suits.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:46.12,0:43:47.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,First of all, that's my machine out there.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:47.95,0:43:49.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Second of all, and much more importantly,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:49.06,0:43:50.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,this is Charles decision.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:50.77,0:43:53.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Charles is fine with the CIA being involved. Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:55.85,0:43:59.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry but, I'm with Erik.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:00.48,0:44:01.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll find them alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:03.60,0:44:04.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,What if I say no?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:06.32,0:44:07.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then good luck using your installation
Dialogue: 1,0:44:07.73,0:44:08.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,without me.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:21.57,0:44:24.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,I call it, Cerebro.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:25.47,0:44:27.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Isn't that Spanish for "Brain"? - Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:28.09,0:44:29.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay so, the electrodes
Dialogue: 1,0:44:29.73,0:44:31.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,connect Charles to the transmitter on the roof.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:31.89,0:44:33.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,And picks up a mutant.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:33.68,0:44:35.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,His brain sends a signal through a relay.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:35.92,0:44:38.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,And then the co-ordinates of their location are printed out here.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:38.81,0:44:40.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,You designed this?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:40.62,0:44:41.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:44.90,0:44:46.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,What an adorable lab rat you make, Charles.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:46.69,0:44:48.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't spoil this for me, Erik.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:48.92,0:44:50.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been a lab rat,
Dialogue: 1,0:44:50.33,0:44:51.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know one when I see one.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:51.69,0:44:52.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, right
Dialogue: 1,0:44:53.53,0:44:55.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you sure we can't shave your head?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:55.42,0:44:56.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't touch my hair.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:41.43,0:45:42.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's working!
Dialogue: 1,0:46:00.81,0:46:01.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,With that Daddy-O,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:01.36,0:46:03.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,you get a private dance.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:07.53,0:46:09.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,You cat's know it's double for both, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:46:10.57,0:46:12.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, that won't be necessary. Although I sure we...
Dialogue: 1,0:46:12.59,0:46:13.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,We were thinking more,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:13.64,0:46:15.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,we're show you ours,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:16.23,0:46:17.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,...if you show us yours.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:17.54,0:46:20.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Baby, that is not the way it works around here.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:22.18,0:46:25.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,- More tea, Vicar? - Don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:28.39,0:46:29.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,My turn.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:47.51,0:46:49.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,How would you like a job,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:49.08,0:46:49.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,where you get to keep your clothes on?
Dialogue: 1,0:46:55.93,0:46:58.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where to fellas? - Richmond, Virginia.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:58.33,0:46:59.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right, so you want the airport,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:59.88,0:47:01.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,the station, what?
Dialogue: 1,0:47:01.05,0:47:04.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,No we were rather hoping that you would take us all the way.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:04.49,0:47:05.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a six hour drive.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:05.96,0:47:08.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,That will give us plenty of time to talk.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:12.40,0:47:13.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell does the government want with
Dialogue: 1,0:47:13.15,0:47:15.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,a guy like, Alex Summers?
Dialogue: 1,0:47:15.35,0:47:17.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't plan on putting him with others.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:17.40,0:47:21.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,First guy I ever met who actually prefers solitary confinement.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:31.40,0:47:33.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Crazy, huh? - What?
Dialogue: 1,0:47:33.69,0:47:36.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,You like fish, I like fish too.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:36.60,0:47:39.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should bide some time and talk about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:42.10,0:47:44.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd rather go out with the fish.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:50.08,0:47:51.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,These fish?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:10.66,0:48:12.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Excuse me I'm Erik Lensher. - Charles Xavier.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:12.72,0:48:13.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go fuck yourselves.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:34.63,0:48:36.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- There's nothing on radar? - No.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:36.79,0:48:38.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sonar? - No.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:39.64,0:48:41.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then we have a problem.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:00.31,0:49:01.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Beautiful, isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:02.81,0:49:07.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,The reason we exist. We are the children of the atom, my love.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:07.55,0:49:09.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have a situation.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:09.42,0:49:11.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,The telepath...
Dialogue: 1,0:49:11.54,0:49:13.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't be able to feel him at this distance.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:13.77,0:49:15.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's like his reach is...
Dialogue: 1,0:49:16.14,0:49:17.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,...amplified.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:20.40,0:49:21.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're recruiting.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:22.70,0:49:25.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,You go on to Russia, I'll handle him.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:27.66,0:49:29.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't stop thinking about the others out there.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:30.14,0:49:32.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,All those minds that I've touched.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:32.77,0:49:35.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,I could feel them, their aspirations,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:35.93,0:49:38.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,their hopes, their ambitions.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:39.17,0:49:41.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,I tell you, we've started something incredible, Erik.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:42.54,0:49:44.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We can help them. - Can we?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:46.01,0:49:49.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Identification, that's how it starts.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:50.53,0:49:54.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then ends with being rounded up. Experimented on, eliminated.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:54.36,0:49:55.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know the story.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:56.28,0:50:00.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have common enemies, Shaw and the Russians they need us.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:00.22,0:50:01.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,For now.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:07.11,0:50:08.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,We should think of code names.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:08.88,0:50:11.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're government agents now, we should have secret code names.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:11.44,0:50:12.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want to be called, Mystique.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:12.94,0:50:15.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn, I wanted to be called, Mystique.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:15.68,0:50:17.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well tough, I called it.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:19.11,0:50:22.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn wang, mysterious to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:24.36,0:50:25.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Darwin, what about you?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:25.78,0:50:27.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, Darwin's already a nickname.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:27.83,0:50:31.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you know, sort of fits. Adapt to survive and all.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:32.48,0:50:33.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:47.40,0:50:49.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Thank you, thank you. - Bravo, bravo.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:49.92,0:50:52.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What about you? - I'm going to be...
Dialogue: 1,0:50:54.21,0:50:54.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Banshee.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:54.84,0:50:57.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to be names after a wailing spirit?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:57.09,0:50:58.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,You might want to cover your ears.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:14.60,0:51:15.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your turn.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:15.21,0:51:20.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,My stage name is Angel. Kind of fits.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:20.04,0:51:23.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You can fly? - Ah, hah. And uh...
Dialogue: 1,0:51:32.68,0:51:36.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's your name? - How about Big Foot?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:36.33,0:51:38.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well you know what they say about guys with big feet?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:39.16,0:51:41.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,And uh, yours are kind of small.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:41.52,0:51:42.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, now.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:43.90,0:51:46.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex, what is your gift? What can you do?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:46.27,0:51:50.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's not um, I just can't do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:50.56,0:51:52.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I can't do it in here. - Can you do it out there?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:52.76,0:51:55.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Why don't you just do it out there. - Come on. Come on, Alex.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:55.76,0:52:00.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex! Alex!
Dialogue: 1,0:52:02.09,0:52:03.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:03.53,0:52:05.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get down when I tell you.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:13.15,0:52:13.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get back.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:19.30,0:52:20.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 1,0:52:21.93,0:52:22.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whatever...
Dialogue: 1,0:52:37.19,0:52:38.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've got Intel that Shaw is
Dialogue: 1,0:52:38.56,0:52:41.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,meeting with the Russian defense chief in Moscow.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:41.42,0:52:43.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,So go ahead, say it.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:43.72,0:52:45.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not here to say "I told you so",
Dialogue: 1,0:52:45.39,0:52:46.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,you know why I'm here.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:46.11,0:52:49.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah. Clearance to bring along your mutants.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:49.07,0:52:50.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fight fire with fire.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:51.19,0:52:52.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:52.55,0:52:54.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're okay with this?
Dialogue: 1,0:52:54.49,0:52:57.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sending in a bunch of untrained unauthorized freaks?
Dialogue: 1,0:52:57.38,0:53:01.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,These "Freaks" are dedicated hard working people.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:02.66,0:53:04.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Plane leaves for Russia in an hour.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:04.47,0:53:06.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you these kids are not ready for, Shaw.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:06.49,0:53:07.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think they're going to surprise you.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:07.60,0:53:09.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,They are an exceptional bunch of young people.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:09.36,0:53:10.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 1,0:53:22.82,0:53:23.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Harder!
Dialogue: 1,0:53:24.70,0:53:25.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Harder!
Dialogue: 1,0:53:28.72,0:53:30.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:53:36.36,0:53:38.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Who destroyed the statue? - It was, Alex.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:39.51,0:53:43.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,No Havok! We have to call him, Havok. That's his name now.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:43.11,0:53:46.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,And we were thinking, you should be, Professor X
Dialogue: 1,0:53:47.11,0:53:49.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you should be, Magneto.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:50.43,0:53:51.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Exceptional.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:56.24,0:53:57.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I expect more from you.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:19.00,0:54:19.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,We got a problem.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:19.97,0:54:22.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - I'm so sorry, this wasn't on the map.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:28.97,0:54:30.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, act normally.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:30.73,0:54:31.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this, all right.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:33.83,0:54:34.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now listen to me..
Dialogue: 1,0:54:37.88,0:54:38.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 1,0:54:39.27,0:54:40.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,To our farm.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:42.84,0:54:43.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Open the back.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:44.10,0:54:45.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,As you wish, as you wish.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:50.24,0:54:52.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, easy, easy. Take it easy, chaps.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:07.82,0:55:09.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anything back there?
Dialogue: 1,0:55:09.27,0:55:10.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothing, it's empty.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:13.90,0:55:15.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Everything's okay? - Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:38.62,0:55:40.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where's Shaw? - Emma.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:41.21,0:55:44.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's a telepath, if I read her, she'll know we're here.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:45.77,0:55:47.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me try something else.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:05.01,0:56:07.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shaw sends his apologies, but he's indisposed.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:07.72,0:56:09.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,He asked me to come in his place.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:10.17,0:56:13.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,But between you and I honey, I'm a lot better company.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:14.73,0:56:15.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please come in.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:21.19,0:56:22.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's not coming.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:24.95,0:56:29.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- So, what now boss? - Now, nothing. We're here for Shaw.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:29.26,0:56:30.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Mission aborted. - The hell it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:30.64,0:56:33.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Erik. - She's his right hand woman.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:33.00,0:56:34.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's good enough for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:34.42,0:56:37.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,The CIA invading the home of a senior Soviet official.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:37.23,0:56:39.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you crazy? - I'm not CIA.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:40.77,0:56:41.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:44.67,0:56:45.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,To your health.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:50.45,0:56:52.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,So you must be busy planning your next move.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:52.71,0:56:53.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,What with the American's
Dialogue: 1,0:56:53.54,0:56:55.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,refusing to remove their missiles from Turkey.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:56.85,0:57:00.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know I can't talk about those things, Miss Frost.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:00.61,0:57:01.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Emma.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:05.27,0:57:09.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,And don't worry, you don't have to say a word.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:25.85,0:57:27.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's going to start world war III single handed.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:27.92,0:57:29.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We have to do something. - Like what?
Dialogue: 1,0:57:29.90,0:57:31.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're moving out. - You can't.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:47.37,0:57:49.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I can't leave him.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:01.55,0:58:03.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,For goodness sake, Erik...
Dialogue: 1,0:58:03.98,0:58:04.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Be calm.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:05.00,0:58:07.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Be calm. Forget my face. Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:12.80,0:58:15.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're beautiful, so beautiful...yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:22.17,0:58:23.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:35.75,0:58:36.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice trick.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:39.17,0:58:40.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:44.88,0:58:45.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:53.85,0:58:56.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can stop trying to read my mind, sugar.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:58.43,0:59:01.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're never going to get anything from me while I'm like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:14.18,0:59:15.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,So then you can just tell us.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:18.13,0:59:19.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where is Shaw?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:25.96,0:59:26.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:33.97,0:59:35.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik, that's enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:43.75,0:59:45.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik, that's enough!
Dialogue: 1,0:59:54.99,0:59:56.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,All yours.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:57.67,1:00:00.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,She won't be shifting into diamond form again.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:00.75,1:00:04.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,But if she does, just give her a gentle tap.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:29.10,1:00:31.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are the children of the atom.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:32.34,1:00:34.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Radiation gave birth to mutants.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:35.40,1:00:39.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,What will kill the humans, will only make us stronger.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:44.15,1:00:45.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Beautiful, isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:48.59,1:00:50.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is worse that we previously imagined.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:53.63,1:00:54.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're taking you with us.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:55.36,1:00:58.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- CIA will want to question you themselves. - I doubt it.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:59.27,1:01:01.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Might be other things to worry about right now.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:07.71,1:01:09.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa, all right.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:10.14,1:01:12.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus, man you are killing me.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:12.42,1:01:14.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't beat yourself up, we got a lot of spare time.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:20.06,1:01:22.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't know the circus was in town.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:22.45,1:01:24.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey come on honey, give us a little, uh...
Dialogue: 1,1:01:25.19,1:01:27.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,No? Come on, let's see the foot.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:28.04,1:01:29.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,There it is, come on Bigfoot. let's go.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:29.98,1:01:32.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey come on, hey.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:36.54,1:01:38.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're just guys being stupid.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:38.39,1:01:41.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guy's being stupid I can handle. I can handle that my whole life.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:41.98,1:01:43.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I'd rather have a bunch
Dialogue: 1,1:01:43.10,1:01:44.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,of guys staring at me with my clothes off,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:44.29,1:01:46.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,then the way these one stare at me.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:47.64,1:01:48.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,At us.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:56.89,1:01:57.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:00.54,1:02:02.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but something doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:11.59,1:02:14.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No news of Shaw? - Not a peep,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:14.08,1:02:15.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,nothing through that back channel.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:28.81,1:02:29.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:47.32,1:02:49.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have an intruder on the main atrium.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:49.40,1:02:50.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are the mutants?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:50.38,1:02:52.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take another step, I'm going to put you down.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:52.14,1:02:54.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course you will, but where do I find the more evolved people?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:56.50,1:02:57.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Send back-up now!
Dialogue: 1,1:03:00.74,1:03:03.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get back, get back, do not leave that room. We're under attack.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:03.73,1:03:05.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Look out! - Shoot it, shoot it!
Dialogue: 1,1:03:19.34,1:03:20.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are the mutants?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:20.70,1:03:23.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Put that man down or we will open fire.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:48.49,1:03:51.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay here my ass. Let's go!
Dialogue: 1,1:03:56.50,1:03:59.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Get back! - We can help, we can help!
Dialogue: 1,1:04:58.92,1:05:00.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, you want the mutants?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:00.81,1:05:01.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're right through that door.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:01.93,1:05:03.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just let us normal people go.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:03.51,1:05:04.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're no...
Dialogue: 1,1:05:13.99,1:05:15.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's the telepath?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:15.72,1:05:17.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Not here. - Too bad.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:18.55,1:05:20.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now I can take this silly thing off.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:22.60,1:05:25.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good evening My name is, Sebastian Shaw.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:27.72,1:05:30.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I am not here to hurt you.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:30.09,1:05:31.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 1,1:05:31.78,1:05:32.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Azazel...
Dialogue: 1,1:05:36.77,1:05:39.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,My friends, there's a revolution coming.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:40.44,1:05:43.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,When mankind discovers who we are, what we can do.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:43.96,1:05:45.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Each of us will face a choice.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:46.39,1:05:50.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Be enslaved, or rise up to rule.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:51.91,1:05:54.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Choose freely, but know that if you are not with us,
Dialogue: 1,1:05:54.38,1:05:58.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,then by definition you are against us.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:58.83,1:06:01.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, you can stay, and
Dialogue: 1,1:06:01.51,1:06:04.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,fight for the people who hate, and fear you.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:05.68,1:06:09.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or you can join me. And live like kings.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:16.01,1:06:17.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,And Queens.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:28.97,1:06:30.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Angel? - Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:31.57,1:06:34.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, we don't belong here.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:35.46,1:06:37.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,And that's nothing to be ashamed of.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:42.66,1:06:44.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to do something.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:59.78,1:07:02.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop, I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:06.55,1:07:07.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good choice.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:09.31,1:07:11.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,So tell me about your mutation.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:12.05,1:07:13.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I adapt to survive.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:17.22,1:07:20.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- So I guess I'm coming with you. - I like that.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:27.30,1:07:29.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Alex, do it! - Get down!
Dialogue: 1,1:07:35.15,1:07:37.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Protecting your fellow, mutants?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:38.43,1:07:41.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a noble gesture. Feels good.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:47.57,1:07:49.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Adapt to this.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:33.26,1:08:34.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:36.39,1:08:39.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Once again, my sympathies
Dialogue: 1,1:08:39.57,1:08:44.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,for your treatment at the hands of the CIA.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:44.41,1:08:46.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,These American's are ruthless.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:48.06,1:08:51.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now they have their missiles placed in Turkey.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:53.45,1:08:57.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,I expect you'll be planning new missile sites of your own.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:58.00,1:08:58.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Somewhere where you know
Dialogue: 1,1:08:59.15,1:09:02.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,the American early warning system
Dialogue: 1,1:09:02.76,1:09:04.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,won't help.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:05.14,1:09:09.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hear Cuba is lovely this time of year.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:09.84,1:09:12.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,And so close to Florida.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:13.52,1:09:15.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Missiles in Cuba?
Dialogue: 1,1:09:17.65,1:09:18.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're serious?
Dialogue: 1,1:09:20.04,1:09:22.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,We may as well declare war.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:23.93,1:09:26.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe I wasn't clear enough.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:28.62,1:09:30.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,You will make this happen.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:33.03,1:09:33.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:34.74,1:09:37.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's see what KGB think about this.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:41.84,1:09:44.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello, General Armivolkoff.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:48.14,1:09:49.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:06.02,1:10:06.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Raven.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:13.32,1:10:15.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've made arrangements for you to be taken home immediately.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:15.35,1:10:17.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're not going home. - What?
Dialogue: 1,1:10:17.64,1:10:20.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He's not going back to prison. - They killed Darwin.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:20.90,1:10:22.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,All the more reason for you to leave.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:22.58,1:10:23.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is over.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:23.85,1:10:27.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Darwin is dead, Charles. And we can't even bury him.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:30.69,1:10:32.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can avenge him.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:35.77,1:10:37.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik, word please.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:41.07,1:10:43.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- They're just kids. - No, they were kids.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:44.25,1:10:46.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shaw has his army, we need ours.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:52.58,1:10:55.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll have to train. All of us.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:56.47,1:10:58.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:59.20,1:11:00.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well we can't stay here.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:01.16,1:11:03.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Even if they reopen the department, it's not safe.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:04.61,1:11:06.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've got no where to go.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:09.02,1:11:10.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, we do.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:11.21,1:11:13.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,The law says we've got to turn her over.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:13.28,1:11:15.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,The law applies to human beings.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:15.59,1:11:18.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,The same laws don't apply to mutants. They're too dangerous.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:18.96,1:11:22.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Times like this, security is more important than liberty.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:23.17,1:11:28.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,- There's a war coming, John. - Yes, but a war with who?
Dialogue: 1,1:11:42.04,1:11:43.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excellent question.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:44.26,1:11:46.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Though I won't call it a war exactly.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:47.10,1:11:50.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,That suggests both sides stand an equal chance of winning.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:00.32,1:12:02.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Captain, no sign of any American ships.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:02.75,1:12:05.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maintain course, full ahead.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:06.08,1:12:08.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Russians have sent their warheads to Cuba.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:09.02,1:12:11.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have a week before their ship hits the coast.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:11.37,1:12:13.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our fleet can be on this line,
Dialogue: 1,1:12:13.43,1:12:15.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,when the Russian missile ship arrives.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:16.28,1:12:18.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,If that ship crosses the line,
Dialogue: 1,1:12:19.43,1:12:21.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,they will have declared war against the United States.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:22.42,1:12:23.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,We will have no choice but
Dialogue: 1,1:12:23.54,1:12:25.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,to retaliate with a full nuclear response.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:26.19,1:12:27.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do we agree?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:32.63,1:12:34.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dispatch the Seventh fleet.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:37.30,1:12:41.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,- This is yours? - No, it's ours.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:47.30,1:12:50.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Honestly Charles, I don't know how you survived.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:50.64,1:12:52.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Living in such hardship.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:52.47,1:12:55.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well it was a hardship softened by me.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:58.18,1:13:00.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, time for the tour.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:13.02,1:13:14.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dear comrades.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:14.99,1:13:17.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,The United States
Dialogue: 1,1:13:17.91,1:13:22.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,have dispatched war ships for Cuba.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:23.12,1:13:27.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,This leaves us with no choice.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:28.38,1:13:31.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Comrade First Secretary.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:32.53,1:13:35.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,We must send in our fleet.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:38.37,1:13:40.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dispatch the fleet!
Dialogue: 1,1:13:46.05,1:13:49.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,President Kennedy has signed a formal proclamation.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:49.09,1:13:52.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Setting up a blockade of all missiles, armed for Cuba.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:53.84,1:13:56.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Soviet Union reacted by terming it
Dialogue: 1,1:13:56.28,1:14:00.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,as step along the road to unleashing a thermal nuclear war.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:10.53,1:14:13.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're sure? - I'm sure.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:13.94,1:14:14.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:22.02,1:14:24.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I can't. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:24.34,1:14:25.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't shoot anybody point blank,
Dialogue: 1,1:14:25.72,1:14:26.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,let alone my friend.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:26.75,1:14:28.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh come on, you know I can deflect it.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:28.62,1:14:30.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're always telling me I should push myself.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:30.19,1:14:31.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you know you can deflect it,
Dialogue: 1,1:14:31.47,1:14:33.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,then you're not challenging yourself.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:35.06,1:14:36.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,What ever happened to the man
Dialogue: 1,1:14:36.07,1:14:37.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,who was trying to raise a submarine?
Dialogue: 1,1:14:38.75,1:14:39.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,What, I can't.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:40.69,1:14:43.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Something that big, I need the situation, the anger.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:43.38,1:14:44.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, the anger isn't enough.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:45.64,1:14:47.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's gotten the job done all this time.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:47.49,1:14:49.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's nearly gotten you killed all this time.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:50.57,1:14:51.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, come here.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:52.55,1:14:54.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's try something a little more challenging.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:56.13,1:14:59.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,My step-father took the possibility of nuclear war quite seriously.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:59.40,1:15:00.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:00.48,1:15:02.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's why he had this bunker built down here.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:02.85,1:15:05.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought we could use it as a practice range of sort.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:05.39,1:15:06.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't think I'm going to blow though the walls?
Dialogue: 1,1:15:07.15,1:15:09.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, he had this place built to with stand a nuclear bomb.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:09.87,1:15:11.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think it can handle you, Alex.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:11.51,1:15:13.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know when I do this, bad things tend to happen.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:14.30,1:15:15.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's because you can't control it.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:15.87,1:15:17.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,It controls you.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:18.32,1:15:21.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's why we're here, Alex. To start your training.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:26.08,1:15:27.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,What you're doing is incredible.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:27.57,1:15:30.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're hitting a pitch sound that at the same resonate frequency of the glass.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:30.58,1:15:31.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's why it shatters.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:31.66,1:15:33.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is like any other muscle in the body.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:33.15,1:15:35.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can control it.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:37.42,1:15:40.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,"In each of us, two natures are at war."
Dialogue: 1,1:15:40.37,1:15:42.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Robert Louis Stevenson, "Jekyll and Hyde".
Dialogue: 1,1:15:42.11,1:15:43.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Top marks.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:43.35,1:15:45.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Still it really wasn't really about good and evil. Was it, Hank.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:45.41,1:15:48.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was about man's animal nature, and his struggle to control it.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:48.63,1:15:49.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,To conform.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:49.87,1:15:52.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is that struggle which is holding you back.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:52.58,1:15:55.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jekyll is afraid of what he could be capable of.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:55.26,1:15:56.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are too.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:56.97,1:15:58.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you're serious about me doing this,
Dialogue: 1,1:15:58.30,1:15:59.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,you might want to get back.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:59.69,1:16:03.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Of course, should I shut the door? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:06.01,1:16:07.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whenever you're ready.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:14.88,1:16:16.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,My god.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:19.50,1:16:21.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will teach you to control this, Alex.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:25.22,1:16:27.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're sure that this will work.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:27.38,1:16:29.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anything is possible. I based the design...
Dialogue: 1,1:16:29.49,1:16:31.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hank, stop talking. Come on.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:31.96,1:16:33.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now remember, scream as hard as you can.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:33.97,1:16:35.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,You need the sound waves to be supersonic.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:35.84,1:16:37.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Catch them at the right angle, and they should carry you.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:38.33,1:16:41.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,"They should carry me." That's reassuring.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:42.38,1:16:43.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:43.98,1:16:45.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,And don't forget to scream.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:55.21,1:16:58.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you want to beat me this time, you have to set the beast free.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:00.23,1:17:04.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,On your marks, get set...GO!
Dialogue: 1,1:17:19.57,1:17:21.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, congratulations, my friend.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:21.45,1:17:23.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Robert Louis Stevenson would have been proud.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:25.24,1:17:26.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Impressive, Hank.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:26.84,1:17:27.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Feet like those,
Dialogue: 1,1:17:27.49,1:17:28.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,all you need is a red nose.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:28.99,1:17:30.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right, Bozo?
Dialogue: 1,1:17:30.77,1:17:31.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm done here.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:31.59,1:17:32.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Alex
Dialogue: 1,1:17:33.94,1:17:35.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hank.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:46.04,1:17:49.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you're using half the concentration to look normal.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:49.26,1:17:52.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then you're only half paying attention to whatever else you do.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:52.67,1:17:55.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just pointing out something that could save your life.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:59.62,1:18:01.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,You want society to accept you.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:02.37,1:18:04.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you can't even accept yourself.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:10.96,1:18:12.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sexy.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:13.13,1:18:14.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is just the prototype.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:14.16,1:18:16.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,The real will look considerably better, it'll be a whole suit.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:16.66,1:18:19.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,See these sensors measure your energy output,
Dialogue: 1,1:18:19.04,1:18:21.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,this panel focuses it and the excess is absorbed.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:21.74,1:18:23.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right try hitting the one in the middle,
Dialogue: 1,1:18:23.05,1:18:24.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,just the one in the middle, mind.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:24.98,1:18:26.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:36.33,1:18:37.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,You ought to see this.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:37.23,1:18:39.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your genes are extraordinary, you know that.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:39.16,1:18:41.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your cells age at half the rate of a normal human.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:41.23,1:18:43.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,When you're forty you will still have the looks of a teenager.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:43.90,1:18:47.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have the most incredible cellular structure I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:52.67,1:18:54.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,You truly believe I'll fly this time?
Dialogue: 1,1:18:54.66,1:18:56.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unreservedly.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:56.35,1:18:57.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I trust you. - The task.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:57.80,1:18:59.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't trust him. - Say nothing.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:00.73,1:19:01.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die!
Dialogue: 1,1:19:01.99,1:19:03.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, look, we're not going to
Dialogue: 1,1:19:03.59,1:19:04.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,make you do anything that your not so...
Dialogue: 1,1:19:04.60,1:19:08.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Here, let me help him. - Erik!
Dialogue: 1,1:19:29.80,1:19:30.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,1:19:31.28,1:19:33.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know you were thinking the same.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:33.95,1:19:35.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wonderful work Hank, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:35.65,1:19:37.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, Alex, I want you to hit the X.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:38.07,1:19:40.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,And try not to hit me, there's a good chap.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:40.65,1:19:43.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're serious? - I'm very serious.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:43.72,1:19:46.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have complete and utter faith in you.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:58.81,1:19:59.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Am I still a Bozo?
Dialogue: 1,1:19:59.94,1:20:02.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, Hank. You're still a Bozo.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:03.54,1:20:04.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,But nice job.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:07.84,1:20:09.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 1,1:20:09.61,1:20:11.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Try turning it to face us.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:30.70,1:20:32.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, I believe the true focus
Dialogue: 1,1:20:32.71,1:20:36.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,lies somewhere between rage and serenity.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:37.76,1:20:40.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Would you mind, if I...
Dialogue: 1,1:21:13.98,1:21:15.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,What did you just do to me?
Dialogue: 1,1:21:17.08,1:21:20.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,I accessed the brightest corner of your memory system.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:22.47,1:21:25.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a very beautiful memory, Erik, thank you.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:25.88,1:21:28.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't know I still had that.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:28.86,1:21:31.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's so much more to you than you know.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:31.59,1:21:33.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not just pain, and anger.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:34.86,1:21:37.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's good too, I felt it.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:37.67,1:21:40.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,And when you can access all that.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:40.09,1:21:43.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,You will possess a power no one can match.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:43.97,1:21:45.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not even me.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:47.18,1:21:49.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, come on. Try again.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:30.79,1:22:31.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:32.08,1:22:34.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,The President is about to make his address.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:36.06,1:22:37.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,It shall be the policy of
Dialogue: 1,1:22:37.58,1:22:40.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,this nation to regard any nuclear missile,
Dialogue: 1,1:22:40.30,1:22:43.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,...crossing the embargo line, that surrounds Cuba,
Dialogue: 1,1:22:43.89,1:22:47.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,as an attack by the Soviet Union on the United States.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:48.14,1:22:52.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Requiring a full retaliatory response, upon the Soviet Union.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:52.17,1:22:54.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's where we're going to find, Shaw. - How do you know?
Dialogue: 1,1:22:54.52,1:22:55.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two super powers facing off,
Dialogue: 1,1:22:55.73,1:22:57.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,and he want's to start world war III.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:58.25,1:23:00.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,He won't leave anything to chance.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:00.11,1:23:01.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,So much for diplomacy.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:01.59,1:23:04.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,I suggest you all get a good nights sleep.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:04.79,1:23:06.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,...ultimately leads to war.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:07.46,1:23:11.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tensions mount as the Soviet Missile ship nears Cuba.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:11.90,1:23:16.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,All diplomatic efforts to avert Nuclear war have thus far failed.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:16.75,1:23:18.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,As the American people ready themselves,
Dialogue: 1,1:23:18.90,1:23:21.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,for the likelihood of an atomic attack.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:21.25,1:23:24.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,There are widespread reports of panic wide.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:24.52,1:23:26.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Supermarkets cleared.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:26.34,1:23:29.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,As shelters unused since the second world war,
Dialogue: 1,1:23:29.23,1:23:31.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,are stocked for what may lie ahead.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:31.82,1:23:36.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,In all its history, American has never faced a greater threat.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:36.48,1:23:40.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,The world is primed for war. And there's no one to stop me.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:46.14,1:23:47.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:50.22,1:23:51.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got a surprise for you.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:00.64,1:24:03.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I isolated the right marker in your DNA sample.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:04.26,1:24:06.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,The serum works like an anti-biotic.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:06.26,1:24:09.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Attacking the cells that cause our physical mutation.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:09.46,1:24:11.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,It won't affect your abilities, just your appearance.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:14.87,1:24:16.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you still want to do this?
Dialogue: 1,1:24:17.95,1:24:20.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Should we have to hide?
Dialogue: 1,1:24:21.36,1:24:22.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,You already do.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:23.34,1:24:26.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're hiding right now. Like I have my whole life.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:26.99,1:24:29.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want to feel like a freak, all the time.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:29.51,1:24:31.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I just want to look... - ...normal.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:31.66,1:24:32.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:39.90,1:24:41.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hank, don't.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:43.23,1:24:44.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're beautiful, Hank.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:44.84,1:24:47.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything you are, you're perfect.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:50.16,1:24:53.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at all of us. Look at all we've achieved this week.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:53.54,1:24:55.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,All we will achieve.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:56.75,1:24:58.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are different.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:59.40,1:25:02.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,But we shouldn't be trying to fit into society.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:02.83,1:25:05.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Society should inspire and be more like us.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:06.83,1:25:10.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mutant, and proud.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:14.98,1:25:16.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,It behooves me to tell you,
Dialogue: 1,1:25:16.63,1:25:18.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,but even if we save the world tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:18.94,1:25:21.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,And mutants are accepted into society.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:22.20,1:25:25.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,My feet and your natural blue form.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:25.96,1:25:28.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Will never be deemed beautiful.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:33.37,1:25:35.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,You look beautiful now.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:36.75,1:25:40.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need this cure.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:06.87,1:26:11.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cuba,Russia,America,makes no difference.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:12.31,1:26:15.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shaw's declared war on mankind, on all of us.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:15.71,1:26:17.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,He has to be stopped.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:18.31,1:26:19.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna stop Shaw.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:20.51,1:26:21.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:24.81,1:26:26.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you have it into all of that ?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:33.12,1:26:35.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've known that all along why I was here, Charles.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:35.87,1:26:37.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,But things have changed.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:38.18,1:26:40.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,What started as a covert mission,
Dialogue: 1,1:26:40.47,1:26:43.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,...tomorrow mankind will know that mutants exist.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:43.48,1:26:46.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shaw, us... they won't differentiate.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:46.31,1:26:50.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,They'll fear us, and that fear will turn to hatred.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:50.22,1:26:53.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not if we stop a war. Not if we can prevent Shaw.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:53.63,1:26:55.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not if we risk our lives doing so.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:55.71,1:26:56.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Would they do the same for us?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:56.79,1:26:58.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have it in us to be the better man.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:58.78,1:27:00.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,We already are.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:00.76,1:27:02.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're the next stage of human evolution.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:02.54,1:27:04.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You said it yourself. - Enough.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:04.64,1:27:06.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you really so naive
Dialogue: 1,1:27:06.50,1:27:09.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,as to think they won't battle their own extinction?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:10.73,1:27:13.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Or is it arrogance? - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:14.29,1:27:16.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,After tomorrow they're going to turn on us.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:16.28,1:27:17.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you're blind to it,
Dialogue: 1,1:27:17.40,1:27:19.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,because you believe they're all like Moira.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:19.82,1:27:21.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you believe they're all like Shaw.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:24.14,1:27:27.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, very carefully my friend.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:28.27,1:27:31.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Killing Shaw will not bring you peace.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:33.00,1:27:35.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Peace was never an option.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:21.63,1:28:22.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:25.01,1:28:26.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:54.79,1:28:56.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 1,1:28:58.24,1:28:59.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is a surprise.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:00.06,1:29:01.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,The nice kind?
Dialogue: 1,1:29:03.32,1:29:06.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Raven, why don't you go to bed.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:06.95,1:29:08.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe in a few years.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:13.26,1:29:14.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,How about now?
Dialogue: 1,1:29:19.97,1:29:21.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,I prefer the real Raven.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:25.41,1:29:28.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I said the real, Raven.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:37.94,1:29:39.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Perfection.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:43.69,1:29:47.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Could you pass me my robe? - You don't have to hide.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:52.01,1:29:53.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have you ever looked at a tiger,
Dialogue: 1,1:29:53.56,1:29:55.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,and thought you'd want to cover it up?
Dialogue: 1,1:29:57.92,1:29:59.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, but...
Dialogue: 1,1:29:59.84,1:30:01.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're an exquisite creature, Raven.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:03.50,1:30:06.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Only in life the world tries to tame you.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:06.86,1:30:08.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to be free.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:29.24,1:30:31.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know sometimes I wonder what my life would have been like.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:31.24,1:30:33.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't found me here that night.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:33.80,1:30:36.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fairable, E..Gah...ah.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:37.48,1:30:39.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,For gods sake, Raven!
Dialogue: 1,1:30:39.41,1:30:41.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are you clothes? Put some, put some clothes on.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:41.93,1:30:44.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's not what you said when you first saw me.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:44.43,1:30:47.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I guess pets are always cuter when they're little, right?
Dialogue: 1,1:30:48.12,1:30:50.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Raven, I don't know what's got into you lately.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:50.37,1:30:51.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be in a good mood.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:52.41,1:30:55.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hank tells me he's found the answer
Dialogue: 1,1:30:55.24,1:30:57.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,to your cosmetic problem.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:59.57,1:31:00.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You going to tell me what's the matter?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:00.88,1:31:02.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or will I have to read your mind?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:02.21,1:31:04.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,You promised me you would never do that.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:04.14,1:31:06.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Until recently, I never had to
Dialogue: 1,1:31:06.48,1:31:08.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,use my powers to know what you were thinking, Raven.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:08.69,1:31:10.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know Charles, I used to think it was gonna be
Dialogue: 1,1:31:10.75,1:31:12.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,you and me against the world.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:12.49,1:31:14.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,And no matter how bad the world gets,
Dialogue: 1,1:31:14.12,1:31:16.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,you don't want to be against it, do you?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:16.10,1:31:17.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,You want to be a part of it.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:39.64,1:31:40.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened here?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:49.43,1:31:50.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hank has been busy.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:51.24,1:31:52.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do we really have to wear these?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:53.51,1:31:56.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,As none of us has mutated to endure extreme G force,
Dialogue: 1,1:31:56.38,1:31:59.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,or being riddled by bullets, I suggest we suit up.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:24.12,1:32:25.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's Hank?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:27.14,1:32:28.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:38.19,1:32:39.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hank?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:45.04,1:32:47.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,It didn't attack the cells.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:47.35,1:32:49.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,It enhanced them.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:51.74,1:32:52.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,It didn't work.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:53.52,1:32:55.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, it did, Hank.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:55.43,1:32:59.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't you see? This is who you were meant to be.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:00.35,1:33:01.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is you.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:03.72,1:33:05.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,No more hiding.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:05.95,1:33:07.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Never looked better, man.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:08.11,1:33:08.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hank!
Dialogue: 1,1:33:10.17,1:33:12.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't mock me.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:12.80,1:33:14.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hank, put him down immediately, please.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:14.52,1:33:15.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hank...HANK!
Dialogue: 1,1:33:18.67,1:33:20.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wasn't.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:20.52,1:33:22.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Even I got to admit, you look pretty bad ass.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:22.79,1:33:26.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think I got a new name for you, Beast.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:28.67,1:33:30.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,You sure you can fly this thing?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:30.52,1:33:33.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course I can, I designed it.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:44.93,1:33:46.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Status of the cargo ship?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:46.83,1:33:49.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bearing 1-8-0, 12 knots.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:52.17,1:33:54.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Three minutes to the embargo line, sir.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:55.63,1:33:57.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,God help them if they cross it.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:00.03,1:34:01.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,God help us all.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:02.03,1:34:03.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sound general quarters.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:03.18,1:34:05.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,General quarters, general quarters.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:05.57,1:34:08.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,- All hands man battle stations! - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:08.32,1:34:10.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Set condition zero.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:10.80,1:34:12.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,General quarters, battle stations.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:22.97,1:34:25.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Captain, we already have our orders.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:25.81,1:34:28.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why so eager for new ones?
Dialogue: 1,1:34:29.08,1:34:32.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've lived through one war, comrade.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:33.98,1:34:36.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer not to start another.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:38.55,1:34:40.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Battle stations, NOW!
Dialogue: 1,1:34:43.59,1:34:48.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gun boss, target cargo ship, bearing 1-8-0.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:50.50,1:34:53.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fleet reports all weapons ready.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:53.71,1:34:55.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,From the Kremlin, sir.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:56.31,1:34:57.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,New orders. As of 1025 hours,
Dialogue: 1,1:34:57.78,1:35:00.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,the cargo vessel Aral sea, is hereby ordered to...
Dialogue: 1,1:35:00.33,1:35:03.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,...reverse course and return to port in Odessa.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:03.62,1:35:05.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aral Sea, come in.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:05.79,1:35:07.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aral Sea, come in.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:08.15,1:35:09.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,They are not responding.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:09.56,1:35:11.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's not turning around.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:11.14,1:35:13.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aral Sea, you are ordered to turn around.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:13.77,1:35:15.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do not cross the line.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:16.44,1:35:17.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Target ready to be fired upon, sir.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:18.37,1:35:20.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Stand by to fire. - Standing by, sir.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:33.91,1:35:35.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks pretty messy out there.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:45.30,1:35:49.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aral Sea, you are ordered to turn around.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:50.49,1:35:53.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,The crew of the Aral Sea are all dead. Shaw's been there.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:53.07,1:35:54.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's still here, somewhere.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:54.84,1:35:56.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's set the ship on course for the embargo line.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:56.61,1:35:58.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,That ship crosses the line, our boys are going to blow it up.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:59.35,1:36:00.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,And the war begins.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:01.40,1:36:03.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unless they're not on board.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:06.01,1:36:08.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,USS Independence, this is, Alexander Nevski.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:08.74,1:36:10.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have lost control of our cargo ship.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:10.81,1:36:13.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's been instructed to stop. Do not fire.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:13.60,1:36:15.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Repeat, do not fire.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:15.43,1:36:17.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,They've signaled their cargo ship to turn around, sir.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:18.75,1:36:22.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a ruse, pay no attention. Stand by to fire.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:22.83,1:36:25.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Standing by to fire, sir. - On my count.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:25.57,1:36:27.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Five...four...
Dialogue: 1,1:36:50.66,1:36:52.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on! Hold on!
Dialogue: 1,1:37:01.37,1:37:02.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 1,1:37:07.01,1:37:09.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What was that? - The Russians,
Dialogue: 1,1:37:09.01,1:37:10.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,they have fired on their own ship.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:11.19,1:37:13.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,A little warning next time, professor.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:13.31,1:37:14.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:14.33,1:37:15.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You all right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:16.68,1:37:17.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 1,1:37:18.44,1:37:21.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me Sinclar on the horn, I want a new set of orders.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:24.69,1:37:27.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, comrade.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:27.51,1:37:31.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,You just averted a Nuclear war.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:31.62,1:37:33.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,1:37:33.11,1:37:34.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take him to the brig.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:34.72,1:37:36.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? What just happened?
Dialogue: 1,1:37:38.63,1:37:40.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,They say the comrade lost his mind.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:40.73,1:37:42.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Americans' are plotting.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:44.45,1:37:45.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're here.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:45.60,1:37:47.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,That telepath is powerful.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:50.04,1:37:51.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're moving to a back-up plan.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:54.65,1:37:56.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That was inspired, Charles. - Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:56.87,1:37:58.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I still can't locate Shaw.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:58.26,1:38:00.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's down there, we need to find him now.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:00.79,1:38:01.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hank?
Dialogue: 1,1:38:01.57,1:38:06.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is there anything unusual on the radar scanners? - No, nothing.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:06.71,1:38:08.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well then he must be under water.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:08.47,1:38:10.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,And obviously we don't have Sonar.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:12.47,1:38:13.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes we do.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:14.35,1:38:15.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes we do.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:19.83,1:38:20.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,They were ready for war.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:21.16,1:38:23.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,We just need to strike another match to light the fuse.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:23.98,1:38:26.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,And we still have the most powerful weapon of all.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:27.48,1:38:28.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:28.90,1:38:30.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Turn the nuclear reactor to
Dialogue: 1,1:38:30.38,1:38:34.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,100% output and make sure I'm not disturbed.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:37.27,1:38:39.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hank, level the bloody plane!
Dialogue: 1,1:38:44.81,1:38:46.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you back right off.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:47.83,1:38:49.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Beast, open the Bombay doors.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:58.33,1:39:02.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Remember, this is a muscle. You control it.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:02.61,1:39:06.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll be in here the entire time. We'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:06.98,1:39:13.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,On my mark. 3, 2, 1 GO!
Dialogue: 1,1:39:29.28,1:39:31.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alert the fleet, they may want to take their cams off.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:45.00,1:39:46.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Banshee's got a location on Shaw.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:49.51,1:39:50.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,You ready for this?
Dialogue: 1,1:39:51.15,1:39:52.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's find out.
Dialogue: 1,1:40:56.17,1:41:00.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Remember, the point between rage and serenity.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:24.38,1:42:25.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik, take my hand!
Dialogue: 1,1:42:27.45,1:42:30.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on guys, it's going to get bumpy.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:45.56,1:42:47.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik, take my hand!
Dialogue: 1,1:43:21.30,1:43:22.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Down.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:38.17,1:43:41.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Moira, Moira, are you all right? - Yeah, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:45.94,1:43:47.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I read the teleporter's mind.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:47.85,1:43:49.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shaw's drawing all of the power out of his sub.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:50.01,1:43:51.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's turning himself into some kind of nuclear bomb.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:52.18,1:43:54.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've got no time, the Geiger counter's going out of control.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:54.43,1:43:55.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right Moira, this is what we're going to do.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:55.46,1:43:57.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get on the radio and send both fleet's out immediately.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:58.28,1:43:58.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going in.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:58.92,1:44:00.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Beast, Havok, back him up.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:00.68,1:44:02.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik, I can guide you through once you're in.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:02.82,1:44:05.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I need you to shut down whatever it is that's blocking me.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:05.34,1:44:07.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then we just hope to god it's not to late for me to stop him.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:07.40,1:44:08.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Got it. - Good luck!
Dialogue: 1,1:44:09.32,1:44:11.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Raven, stop! - I'm going out there.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:11.41,1:44:12.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:12.34,1:44:14.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anything comes in that entrance, you're taking care of it, ok?
Dialogue: 1,1:44:15.68,1:44:16.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:32.94,1:44:33.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Beast!
Dialogue: 1,1:44:37.77,1:44:39.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,If we go, you go
Dialogue: 1,1:44:42.83,1:44:45.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,We believe Shaw is trying to detonate some kind of bomb.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:50.35,1:44:52.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik, make for the middle of the vessel.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:53.03,1:44:54.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the point my mind can't penetrate.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:54.55,1:44:56.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to assume that, that's where Shaw is.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:05.79,1:45:07.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gang way, gang way.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:14.69,1:45:17.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the nuclear reactor. Disable it.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:29.75,1:45:31.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop, don't move.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:39.39,1:45:40.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 1,1:46:04.21,1:46:05.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik you're there, you've reached the void.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:05.87,1:46:07.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's not here Charles, Shaw is not here.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:07.71,1:46:10.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He's left the sub. - What? He's got to be there.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:10.17,1:46:12.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,He has to be, there's no where else he can be, keep looking.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:12.46,1:46:15.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I'm telling you he's not, there's no one here, god damn it!
Dialogue: 1,1:46:19.05,1:46:22.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik, what a pleasant surprise.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:22.86,1:46:24.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik? Erik!
Dialogue: 1,1:46:27.26,1:46:28.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,So good to see you again.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:45.64,1:46:47.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,May I ask you something?
Dialogue: 1,1:46:48.86,1:46:50.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why are you on their side?
Dialogue: 1,1:46:50.76,1:46:51.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He's gone. - What?
Dialogue: 1,1:46:51.84,1:46:54.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's gone into the void. I can't communicate with him there.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:55.07,1:46:57.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why fight for a doomed race who will hunt us down,
Dialogue: 1,1:46:57.71,1:46:59.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,...as soon as they realize their reign
Dialogue: 1,1:46:59.27,1:47:00.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,is coming to an end.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:44.26,1:47:46.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for what happened in the camps.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:48.46,1:47:49.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I truly am.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:58.64,1:47:59.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's back.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:00.01,1:48:03.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik, whatever you're doing keep doing it, it's starting to work.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:04.23,1:48:07.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,But everything I did, I did for you.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:07.59,1:48:11.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,To unlock your power. To make you embrace it.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:15.02,1:48:16.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's working.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:16.25,1:48:18.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to see him, but I can't yet touch his mind.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:32.93,1:48:35.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've come a long way from bending gates.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:36.03,1:48:37.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of you.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:45.59,1:48:48.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you're just starting to scratch the surface.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:48.47,1:48:52.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Think how much further we could go, together.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:12.26,1:49:14.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop, Azazel!
Dialogue: 1,1:49:29.47,1:49:32.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hurt you, Erik. I never did.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:32.90,1:49:34.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want to help you.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:34.33,1:49:37.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is our time. Our age.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:38.62,1:49:41.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are the future of the human race.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:43.01,1:49:47.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,You and me, son. This world could be ours.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:49.70,1:49:52.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything you did, made me stronger.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:54.58,1:49:56.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Made me the weapon I am today.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:58.82,1:50:00.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the truth.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:01.67,1:50:03.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've known it all along.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:09.77,1:50:11.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are my creator.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:12.57,1:50:13.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,NOW, Charles!
Dialogue: 1,1:50:15.66,1:50:16.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,1:50:16.63,1:50:19.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Moira be quiet, I can only control this man for so long.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:32.87,1:50:34.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Charles.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:34.13,1:50:36.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik please, be the better man. You have it in...
Dialogue: 1,1:50:36.50,1:50:37.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I don't trust you.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:37.30,1:50:38.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik, there will be no telling that...
Dialogue: 1,1:50:40.91,1:50:41.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:42.86,1:50:44.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Charles? - Don't do this, Erik!
Dialogue: 1,1:50:52.01,1:50:54.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you're in there, I'd like you to know that
Dialogue: 1,1:50:54.72,1:50:56.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I agree with every word you've said.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:59.21,1:51:00.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are the future.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:03.50,1:51:04.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 1,1:51:06.31,1:51:09.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,...unfortunately, you killed my mother.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:19.05,1:51:20.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is what we're going to do.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:20.83,1:51:22.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, please Erik, no.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:23.13,1:51:26.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going to count to three. And I'm going to move the coin.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:28.79,1:51:30.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,One...
Dialogue: 1,1:51:31.77,1:51:33.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please, Erik.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:41.50,1:51:42.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two...
Dialogue: 1,1:51:49.60,1:51:50.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:19.80,1:52:22.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Russians share our concerns.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:22.89,1:52:25.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,And will join a strike on all the mutants.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:25.84,1:52:27.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can end this threat for good.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:28.11,1:52:29.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll never have another opportunity like this.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:30.05,1:52:31.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have an agent on that beach.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:31.99,1:52:35.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- One agent. - She's a good agent.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:35.37,1:52:36.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's collateral damage.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:43.23,1:52:45.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Today our fighting stops.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:09.61,1:53:12.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take off your blinders, brothers and sisters.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:12.83,1:53:14.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,The real enemy is out there.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:16.57,1:53:18.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I feel their guns moving in the water.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:19.08,1:53:21.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Their metal targeting us.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:21.60,1:53:25.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Americans, Soviets, humans.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:26.55,1:53:28.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,United in their fear of the unknown.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:30.06,1:53:33.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,A Neanderthal is running scared, my fellow mutants.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:36.11,1:53:37.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Charles.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:39.65,1:53:41.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:01.30,1:54:04.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fleet commander this is X-ray Bravo-70.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:04.32,1:54:05.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Respond, over.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:06.79,1:54:09.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,The beach is secure, call off the attack.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:09.45,1:54:11.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,The beach is targeted and ready to be fired upon, sir.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:12.06,1:54:13.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Stand by. - Standing by, sir.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:18.30,1:54:22.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello? Hello!
Dialogue: 1,1:54:30.66,1:54:32.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fire. Fire.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:21.78,1:55:23.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik, you said yourself, we're the better men.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:24.62,1:55:26.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is the time to prove it.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:30.06,1:55:32.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,There are thousands of men on those ships.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:32.13,1:55:33.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,getting orders, innocent men.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:34.52,1:55:36.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're just following orders.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:38.45,1:55:40.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been at the mercy of men just following orders.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:45.58,1:55:47.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Never again.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:51.61,1:55:53.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik Release them !
Dialogue: 1,1:55:59.81,1:56:01.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Noooooooo
Dialogue: 1,1:56:07.61,1:56:10.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hurt you,don't make me.
Dialogue: 1,1:56:10.81,1:56:11.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay back !
Dialogue: 1,1:56:21.01,1:56:22.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik, stop!
Dialogue: 1,1:56:32.69,1:56:34.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, it's been an honor serving with you.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:25.21,1:57:26.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:26.44,1:57:28.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,I said back off!
Dialogue: 1,1:57:30.05,1:57:32.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,You, you did this!
Dialogue: 1,1:57:37.80,1:57:38.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 1,1:57:41.19,1:57:44.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,She didn't do this, Erik. You did.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:52.71,1:57:56.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Us turning on each other, it's what they want.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:56.79,1:57:58.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I tried to warn you, Charles.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:01.41,1:58:05.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want you by my side. We're brothers, you and I.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:06.28,1:58:09.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,All of us, together. Protecting each other.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:11.45,1:58:13.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,We want the same thing.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:14.07,1:58:15.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my friend.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:16.75,1:58:19.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we do not.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:36.32,1:58:40.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Charles, I'm sorry, I'm so sorry, Charles.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:40.14,1:58:42.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's all right, it's all right.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:46.13,1:58:48.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,His society won't accept us.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:49.66,1:58:51.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,We form our own.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:51.53,1:58:53.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,The humans has played their hand.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:56.07,1:58:57.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now we get ready to play ours.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:01.20,1:59:02.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's with me?
Dialogue: 1,1:59:14.02,1:59:15.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,No more hiding.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:41.92,1:59:46.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,You, you should go with him. It's what you want.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:47.24,1:59:49.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,You promised me you would never read my mind.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:49.86,1:59:50.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:51.40,1:59:53.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I promised you a great many things, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:54.77,1:59:55.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:01.39,2:00:02.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take care of him.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:18.09,2:00:20.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,And Beast, never forget.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:21.96,2:00:24.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mutant and proud.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:33.64,2:00:34.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help me out, help him.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:36.05,2:00:37.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get you to a hospital.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:38.05,2:00:41.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't, Charles, don't move, okay.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:41.46,2:00:46.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, actually I ca.....I...I...
Dialogue: 1,2:00:48.37,2:00:50.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't feel my legs
Dialogue: 1,2:00:51.86,2:00:53.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't feel my legs.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:55.40,2:00:57.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't feel my legs.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:09.16,2:01:10.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,In this week of Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:10.80,2:01:12.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,There is much for which we can be grateful.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:12.84,2:01:16.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,As you look back to where we stood, only four weeks ago.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:16.42,2:01:19.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,The unity of this hemisphere, the support of our allies.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:19.90,2:01:22.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,And the calm determination of the American people.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:22.86,2:01:25.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,These qualities may be tested many more times.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:25.83,2:01:27.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,In this decade.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:29.84,2:01:32.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,So how many students do you think you'll have here?
Dialogue: 1,2:01:32.65,2:01:34.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Once you get the academy up and running.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:35.00,2:01:38.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,As many as I can manage. Possibly more.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:41.82,2:01:42.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, one day the government
Dialogue: 1,2:01:43.76,2:01:46.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,is going to realize how lucky they were,
Dialogue: 1,2:01:46.34,2:01:48.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,..To have Professor X on their side.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:48.30,2:01:49.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,2:01:50.01,2:01:52.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,It has been on the road to a professor now, aren't I.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:52.38,2:01:54.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,First thing I'll be going bald.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:55.67,2:01:57.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're still on the government's side, Moira.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:58.57,2:02:01.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're still a G-man, just without the G.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:01.63,2:02:04.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, you're your own team now.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:05.26,2:02:06.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's better.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:07.46,2:02:09.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're, "X-Men".
Dialogue: 1,2:02:11.43,2:02:13.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, I like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:14.40,2:02:20.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Moira, for us anonymity will be the first line of defense.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:20.75,2:02:21.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:23.41,2:02:26.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,They can threaten me all they want, Charles.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:28.04,2:02:29.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll never tell them where you are.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:30.88,2:02:31.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ever.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:32.93,2:02:34.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you won't.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:36.40,2:02:37.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,My love.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:45.13,2:02:47.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I remember the attack on HQ.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:47.97,2:02:49.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Leaving to go somewhere else.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:50.38,2:02:53.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,And then this morning, I woke up at home.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:54.50,2:02:55.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:56.71,2:02:59.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,All that time wiped clean from your mind.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:59.26,2:03:00.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just gone.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:00.82,2:03:02.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,He can do that. You don't remember anything?
Dialogue: 1,2:03:03.46,2:03:05.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I get fragments.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:05.89,2:03:11.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like trees, sunlight.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:13.42,2:03:15.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- A kiss. - Aw, Jesus.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:16.55,2:03:19.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, this is why the CIA is no place for a woman.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:24.97,2:03:26.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 1,2:03:43.04,2:03:45.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know we've had our differences.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:47.94,2:03:51.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where's your telepath friend? - Gone.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:52.86,2:03:55.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Left a bit of a gap in my life. If I'm to be honest.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:55.86,2:03:57.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was rather hoping you would fill it.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:03.24,2:04:04.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Join us.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:11.79,2:04:13.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik, I believe.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:16.98,2:04:18.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I prefer...
Dialogue: 1,2:04:20.57,2:04:21.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Magneto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,(波兰  1944年)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.61,0:02:21.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,(纽约  韦斯切斯特富人区  1944年)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:51.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈  你在干嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.29,0:02:53.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还以为是小偷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.66,0:02:55.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,没想到吓着你了  亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:02:57.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是拿点吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.81,0:02:58.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,去睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.62,0:03:01.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:03.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,去睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.67,0:03:08.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我给你做杯热巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.42,0:03:10.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.32,0:03:16.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你把我妈妈怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:20.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我妈妈从不踏进厨房半步
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.12,0:03:24.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,她不可能做热巧克力给我喝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.61,0:03:27.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,只会指使我来干这些
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.45,0:03:48.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不怕我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:51.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直不信我是世上唯一的...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:54.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,唯一的...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.13,0:03:56.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,与众不同的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:04:01.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在你来了  我叫查尔斯·泽维尔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:05.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我叫瑞雯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.05,0:04:08.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,你饿了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.21,0:04:10.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,随便拿着吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.73,0:04:12.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有很多食物  你用不着偷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:15.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,其实...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.14,0:04:19.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,...你以后再也不用偷了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.39,0:04:36.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要明白  埃里克
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.72,0:04:41.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不像这些纳粹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:46.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,基因是关键
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:49.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,但它们能决定什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:53.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,金发碧眼吗  那就太可悲了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.43,0:05:01.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,吃点巧克力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.27,0:05:03.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,味道很好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.02,0:05:05.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,来点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.41,0:05:09.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想见我妈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.92,0:05:21.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,基因是开启新世纪大门的钥匙  埃里克
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:25.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,人类的一个新未来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:27.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,进化
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:31.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道我在说什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:35.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要你做的事很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.20,0:05:41.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,这枚硬币比那扇大门容易多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.56,0:05:43.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.82,0:06:00.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我尽力了  博士先生...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:04.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我做...做不到...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:07.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:12.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,对于纳粹  有一件事我可以肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:15.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们采用的方法都很有效
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.77,0:06:19.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,很抱歉  埃里克
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:31.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.51,0:06:33.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.80,0:06:36.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.94,0:06:41.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来说说我们将要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.60,0:06:45.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我数到三...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.91,0:06:48.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,...你来移动这枚硬币
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.48,0:06:54.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你移动不了  我就扣下扳机
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.27,0:06:57.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.38,0:07:00.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,一...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.93,0:07:04.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈  - 你做得到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.29,0:07:10.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,二...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:14.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:26.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.64,0:07:30.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:32.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,三
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.23,0:07:55.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:06.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.71,0:08:52.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,真棒  埃里克
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:57.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,愤怒开启了你的天赋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.82,0:09:02.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,愤怒和痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.30,0:09:09.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和我   我们可以一起共创大业
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.72,0:09:33.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,《X战警：第一战》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:10:00.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,(瑞士  日内瓦  1962年)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.29,0:10:16.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,(英国  牛津大学)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.74,0:10:25.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,异色症
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:29.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,作为一名绅士  至少该请我喝杯饮料吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.58,0:10:32.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,纽曼  我要一品脱苦啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.52,0:10:33.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,给这位女士来杯白兰地
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.57,0:10:36.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道我想喝什么  - 侥幸猜中
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.29,0:10:38.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我叫泽维尔  查尔斯·泽维尔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.21,0:10:39.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你好...- 我叫艾米
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.58,0:10:41.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,异色症  是从你眼睛里看出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.65,0:10:43.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,那双眼睛真迷人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.06,0:10:46.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,一只绿色  一只蓝色  是一种变异
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.72,0:10:48.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,一种绝妙的变异
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.28,0:10:51.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉你  艾米  你是个变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.57,0:10:52.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,先和姑娘调情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.95,0:10:54.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,接着叫她怪胎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.13,0:10:57.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是你勾引姑娘的策略吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.44,0:10:58.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,明早再告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.75,0:10:59.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了  好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.71,0:11:01.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,不开玩笑了  你肯定不信
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.47,0:11:02.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,变异是单细胞生物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:05.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,进化成占主导地位的生命体的过程
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.16,0:11:07.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这星球上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.30,0:11:10.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,每一代生物的进化
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.26,0:11:13.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,都由变异引起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.36,0:11:15.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我们换个词吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.40,0:11:22.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 突变  自豪  - 干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:24.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来我得自己买饮料了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.47,0:11:25.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,很抱歉  来杯可乐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.82,0:11:26.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,查尔斯只是想告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.10,0:11:28.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就像个第一批长出腿的...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:29.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,海洋生物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.66,0:11:30.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,有点性感
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.57,0:11:33.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉  这位是我的妹妹  瑞雯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.63,0:11:37.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你好  艾米  - 你学什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:39.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,服务员
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:44.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,看  你也有异色症
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.83,0:11:47.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么  - 看她的眼睛...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:52.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧  瑞雯拿上你的外套
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.51,0:11:55.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,别和我说你是故意的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:56.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不是  - 你是故意的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:11:57.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么我要故意那样干
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.81,0:11:59.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道我有时候也控制不了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:00.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,压力大了或累了的时候...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:02.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,刚才你的变形真是天衣无缝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:04.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,突变  自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.69,0:12:06.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么变种人也会很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:08.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,或是像你这样  长相平常
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.41,0:12:09.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你是个怪胎  最好躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:12.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是太荒谬了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.28,0:12:14.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着  我不想像个老古板一样说话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:15.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就是个老古板
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.80,0:12:18.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,有时会  但我们聊过这问题  瑞雯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.67,0:12:21.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,小失误在所难免
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.19,0:12:23.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,犯大错就不堪设想了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.25,0:12:31.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,突变  自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:35.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,突变  自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:47.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:56.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你会和我约会吗  - 当然会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.09,0:12:58.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,男人拥有了你  都会觉得很幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.90,0:13:01.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你很漂亮  - 就像这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.41,0:13:02.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,像  什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:07.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,蓝色
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.61,0:13:13.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是我老朋友  - 也是你唯一的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.77,0:13:14.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是荣幸之至
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.85,0:13:16.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:18.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这样我想都不会想
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.30,0:13:20.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得要对你负责
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.96,0:13:23.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,其他想法都是错的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:25.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,但如果你不了解我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.37,0:13:26.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我很了解你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.02,0:13:28.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你最近怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.57,0:13:30.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,特别在乎自己的容貌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:36.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要睡了  给我读点东西好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.78,0:13:39.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行  我的论文快交了  我得学习
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.23,0:13:40.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧  就读你的论文吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.45,0:13:41.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,那样睡着得快
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.41,0:13:46.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,对于尼安德特智人来说  他的突变远亲智人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.53,0:13:47.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,是一种畸变
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.32,0:13:50.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果他们曾和平共处过的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:52.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,也很短暂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:54.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,据史料记载  在任何地区
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.56,0:13:56.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,突变人种的到来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:13:58.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,将导致
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.38,0:14:01.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,进化慢的同类立即灭绝   无一例外
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.30,0:14:11.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,保存这样的黄金是非法的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.80,0:14:15.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我该通知警察  - 我们别兜圈子了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:19.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你从哪里得到了这东西  - 朋友那里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.66,0:14:23.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,他竭力推荐你们银行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:25.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.36,0:14:27.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,你了解我们的条款吗  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.09,0:14:29.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.77,0:14:32.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也该了解我的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.56,0:14:38.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,这块金砖是我的人民的遗物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:42.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,融合他们的财物  撬下他们的金牙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.03,0:14:45.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是血腥钱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.40,0:14:46.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要帮我找出
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:49.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,幕后元凶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:55.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,别碰警铃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:15:02.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要找施密特  克劳斯·施密特
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:03.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,他在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.52,0:15:06.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的客户不提供住址  我们不...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.67,0:15:08.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是那种银行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.37,0:15:18.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,金属填料  不是金的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:20.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,担心被人偷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.93,0:15:24.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿根廷  施密特在阿根廷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.33,0:15:28.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,维拉格塞尔酒店  求你了  别
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.05,0:15:45.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.69,0:15:53.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很想杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:16:02.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,记住我的话  如果你警告别人  我就会...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:05.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,...找到你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.09,0:16:12.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,(内华达州  拉斯维加斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.48,0:16:19.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,又忙活了一天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.87,0:16:22.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是亨得利上校吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:24.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 北约的吗  - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:27.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.82,0:16:29.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为那儿还有三个大人物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.52,0:16:32.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,意大利大使  还有洛克希德的首席执行官
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.64,0:16:34.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们不可能都是共产党
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.46,0:16:36.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个地狱火俱乐部里肯定另有阴谋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:42.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,看到了吗  有美女
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:45.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.82,0:16:48.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.33,0:16:50.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,中情局没教过我这样干
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.19,0:16:52.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这等我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.47,0:16:57.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 亨得利上校吗  - 是的  夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.54,0:17:00.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是艾玛·弗罗斯特  塞巴斯汀·尚的合伙人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.99,0:17:03.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,尚先生呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.90,0:17:07.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们正在办派对  我带来点娱乐节目
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:08.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.61,0:17:48.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,美人  你好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.22,0:17:51.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,小宝贝  想到个安静的地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:54.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,很抱歉  亨得利上校已经预定我了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.33,0:17:58.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,借过
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.28,0:18:22.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不再喝一杯吗  鲍伯  - 不了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:24.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,听说你阻止了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.69,0:18:27.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,在土耳其部署朱庇特导弹的提案
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.23,0:18:32.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望你可以重新考虑一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.07,0:18:34.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,这事我们已经讨论过了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.47,0:18:35.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,在土耳其部署核武器
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.88,0:18:38.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,或任何靠近俄罗斯的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:41.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是挑起战争  核战争
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:16.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是在请求帮助  上校
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.62,0:19:18.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在表达我的期望
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.22,0:19:21.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我再说一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.40,0:19:25.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望你可以再考虑一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:28.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有一件事我会重新考虑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.09,0:19:32.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就是再来一杯香醇的香槟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.71,0:19:47.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在我酒里放了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.53,0:20:07.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,还以为你能跑掉  躲起来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:09.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们找得到你  亨得利
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.38,0:20:12.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,世上没有一个堡垒我们进不去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.07,0:20:32.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,她很耀眼吧  鲍伯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:37.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,基因变异  人类基因的进化
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.45,0:20:39.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿撒佐恶魔在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.53,0:20:47.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,别让上校迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.63,0:20:52.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.61,0:20:58.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,在土耳其部署导弹  会传达一个很明确的信息
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.46,0:20:59.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以随时发射
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.67,0:21:00.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏联的预警系统
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.81,0:21:02.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,还没来得及启用
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.37,0:21:03.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说的最好很重要  麦克塔哥特
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.17,0:21:05.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,慢点说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.54,0:21:07.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你抽了什么  晕了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.55,0:21:08.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,人是不会凭空消失的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.11,0:21:10.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,亨得利上校也在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.49,0:21:12.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,他刚才也在  麦克尼  在地狱火俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:13.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,亨得利上校
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.81,0:21:17.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我同意  将军  我重新考虑了我的立场
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:20.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在我觉得应该在土耳其部署导弹
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.31,0:21:22.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,亨得利上校在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.45,0:21:23.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,除非在刚才十分钟里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.80,0:21:25.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,他魔术般地穿越了三千英里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.83,0:21:29.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着  你就别再浪费我时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.34,0:21:31.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,看起来亨得利想发动第三次世界大战
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:33.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在我要处理很多要事  麦克塔哥特
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.24,0:21:35.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,长官  我...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:38.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.63,0:21:40.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:44.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们去找个基因变异的专家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.91,0:21:49.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,遗传学教授  查尔斯·弗朗西斯·泽维尔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.73,0:21:54.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,做教授的感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.09,0:21:56.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,别那样叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.09,0:21:57.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,除非有课可上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.39,0:21:58.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢被称作教授
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.85,0:21:59.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道  但这和你很相称
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.08,0:22:01.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,别那样说  应该说  我们去喝一杯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.80,0:22:03.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们去喝一杯吧  - 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:19.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,(阿根廷  维拉格塞尔酒店)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.65,0:22:34.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 晚上好  朋友们  - 晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.55,0:22:35.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 天真热  - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.09,0:22:37.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,请来杯啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.03,0:22:47.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,(卡斯珀蒂娜号  迈阿密)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.50,0:23:03.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 德国啤酒吗  - 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.09,0:23:07.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是碧特博格啤酒  你喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:15.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,最好的啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.75,0:23:22.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们怎么会来阿根廷的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.32,0:23:29.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里的气候不错   我是养猪的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.70,0:23:35.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我从小是个裁缝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.87,0:23:38.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我父亲是杜塞尔多夫最好的裁缝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.45,0:23:41.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我父母也来自杜塞尔多夫
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.83,0:23:46.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们叫什么  - 他们没名字
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.57,0:23:50.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们的名字被人夺走了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.93,0:23:52.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,...被养猪的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.62,0:23:54.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,...被裁缝
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.18,0:24:25.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,血统与荣誉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.96,0:24:27.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,你喜欢哪个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.02,0:24:31.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们只是听命行事  - 那就流血吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.68,0:24:36.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别动  混蛋  - 快开枪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.05,0:24:59.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是谁  还是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.15,0:25:04.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,就把我当成"科学怪人"吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.97,0:25:18.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在寻找我的造物主
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:28.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,喝  喝  喝
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.36,0:25:42.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,真为你感到骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.91,0:25:46.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得再来一瓶啤酒 你得再来瓶可乐
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.11,0:25:52.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 恭喜你  教授  - 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.91,0:25:54.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,实际上比看起来的难多了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.49,0:25:55.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,不  我是说你的演讲很成功
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.81,0:25:56.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你听过我的演讲吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.07,0:25:58.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,真好  非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.54,0:25:59.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我叫莫伊洛·麦克塔哥特
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.70,0:26:00.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是查尔斯·泽维尔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.58,0:26:01.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以聊一会儿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.62,0:26:06.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了漂亮的变异Mcr-1基因  可以聊五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.74,0:26:11.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说的Mcr-1  就是你们说的金发
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.58,0:26:14.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是种变异  一种绝妙的变异
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.17,0:26:19.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,变异就是  把我们从单细胞生物
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.67,0:26:21.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,变成了占主导地位的人类...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.24,0:26:24.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,这一套可能对女学生很有吸引力
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.11,0:26:25.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我是为了公事而来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.77,0:26:26.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.01,0:26:28.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.97,0:26:30.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.38,0:26:32.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,在你论文中
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.40,0:26:33.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,谈到过的那种变异
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.94,0:26:36.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想知道那是否已经发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.64,0:26:38.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,当今世上是否已存在变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.21,0:26:51.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,教授
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.74,0:26:56.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看还是等你清醒了再谈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.36,0:26:57.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你明天有时间吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.21,0:27:00.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.32,0:27:02.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,你已经找到了问题的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.15,0:27:06.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,这对我也很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.34,0:27:08.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会尽最大努力帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.17,0:27:10.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.22,0:27:13.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,(佛罗里达州  迈阿密)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.35,0:27:15.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,还喝香槟吗  鲍伯
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.61,0:27:17.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,不喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.77,0:27:21.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了  不开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.29,0:27:25.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,你把我们的计划告诉谁了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.06,0:27:26.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,没人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.87,0:27:30.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,他说的是事实
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.97,0:27:31.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.13,0:27:34.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,那这儿就没什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.18,0:27:36.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们收拾东西走人怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.21,0:27:42.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不至于笨得相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.81,0:27:47.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,你现在   给我钱放我走
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.50,0:27:51.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,否则我就拉开拉环  我们同归于尽
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.10,0:27:54.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,行啊  拉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.11,0:27:56.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会的  对天发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.60,0:28:07.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,不  你不会
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.17,0:28:13.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是我会
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.92,0:28:28.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也是变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.10,0:28:31.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,聪明  亨得利上校
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.22,0:28:32.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,猜猜看我能做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.06,0:28:34.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能吸收能量
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.37,0:28:36.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,这让我保持年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.40,0:28:37.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,这没什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.82,0:28:41.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,有意思的是我能利用吸收的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.20,0:28:48.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,(弗吉尼亚  兰利  中央情报局总部)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.50,0:28:49.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,核时代的到来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.44,0:28:51.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能会加速基因变异的进程
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.81,0:28:56.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,拥有超能力的人或许就在我们之间
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.34,0:28:58.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.38,0:28:59.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,麦克塔哥特  你真的觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.89,0:29:02.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个胡扯的科学家会让我相信
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.72,0:29:05.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,银光闪闪的女人和瞬移男人的存在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.11,0:29:06.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是给自己找了一条路
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.53,0:29:07.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,回到原来的打字小组去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.34,0:29:09.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,会议结束
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.45,0:29:12.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,请先坐下  麦克塔哥特特工
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.28,0:29:15.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不指望你们相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.33,0:29:16.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,考虑到你们在我做陈述的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.76,0:29:18.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,满脑子想的都是今天食堂里
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.50,0:29:20.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,提供的到底是哪种馅饼
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.01,0:29:22.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,是苹果山核桃馅饼
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.15,0:29:25.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没有对你完全坦诚  我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.52,0:29:30.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我所拥有的超能力之一就是
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.07,0:29:32.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能知道你在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.62,0:29:34.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看过那个魔术
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.94,0:29:36.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你现在是不是要让我们
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.64,0:29:38.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,在一到十之间想一个数字
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.06,0:29:39.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,不  斯特瑞克特工
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.95,0:29:42.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然我会问你刚才想的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.82,0:29:43.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,儿子威廉的事
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.72,0:29:44.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.75,0:29:46.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我还是更想问你有关
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.66,0:29:49.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,美国正在土耳其部署朱比特中程导弹的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.72,0:29:52.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是个该死的间谍
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.82,0:29:54.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你竟然带来了一个间谍
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.48,0:29:56.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没有  我不可能带间谍来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.68,0:30:17.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个魔术怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.38,0:30:21.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,无与伦比
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.26,0:30:24.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我希望他们离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.29,0:30:27.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,关好他们  直到我想出对策
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.14,0:30:32.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我带他们去我的基金吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.02,0:30:35.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,真叫人难以相信
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.86,0:30:38.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还以为中情局首脑能冷静一点
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.04,0:30:39.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在应该追查尚
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.52,0:30:41.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,他却在担心其他变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.24,0:30:43.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办  雷维
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.13,0:30:47.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,雷维  雷维  你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.29,0:30:50.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,他没怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.62,0:30:53.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是暂时将他定住  我想和你谈话
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.11,0:30:54.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,这很好  不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.40,0:30:57.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我和你一样对塞巴斯汀·尚很感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.31,0:30:58.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你还需要我的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.48,0:31:00.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,就到三楼的停车库来见我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.53,0:31:04.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直相信你们这种人的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.30,0:31:06.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然这一直被大家当成笑柄
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.19,0:31:07.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是我相信这是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.91,0:31:09.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会喜欢我的基地
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.15,0:31:10.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,那必须得等会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.38,0:31:10.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.11,0:31:13.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,麦克塔哥特要带我们去见塞巴斯汀·尚
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.06,0:31:15.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在不去  他就要溜了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.47,0:31:16.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.20,0:31:17.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不仅仅可以读心
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.67,0:31:19.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,也可以和他们交流
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.50,0:31:21.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我和莫伊洛刚刚聊得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.39,0:31:22.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊没错
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.69,0:31:23.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,真难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.10,0:31:26.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是没有上级的许可
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.00,0:31:28.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能带你们去别的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.36,0:31:29.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还想看魔术吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.72,0:31:30.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,想
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.29,0:31:31.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就上车
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.09,0:31:31.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.33,0:31:54.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好医生
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.01,0:32:00.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,小埃里克·勒舍尔
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.42,0:32:02.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是来杀你的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.67,0:32:12.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是哪门子的待客之道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.92,0:32:17.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,过了这么多年
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.32,0:32:27.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾玛
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.03,0:32:30.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不该伤害我们的同类
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.53,0:32:35.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在才是真正的派对
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.17,0:32:38.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是美国海岸警卫队
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.13,0:32:40.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,不许移动你们的船只
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.12,0:32:42.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,留在原地
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.93,0:32:50.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们有人会心灵感应
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.87,0:32:55.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我感应不到尚了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.20,0:32:57.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,感应断了  断了  尚
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.90,0:32:59.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,有...有人阻碍我
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.80,0:33:00.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,这之前从来没有发生过
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.74,0:33:02.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,那艘船上有和我一样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.90,0:33:03.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,和你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.92,0:33:05.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉  是心灵感应
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.53,0:33:06.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,真不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.16,0:33:07.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以感受到她
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.92,0:33:08.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.53,0:33:10.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,估计今晚我可能帮不了什么忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.29,0:33:11.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,靠你们自己了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.14,0:33:26.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 天哪  - 上帝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.14,0:33:31.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,到里面去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.18,0:33:38.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,停下  停下  停下
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.88,0:33:42.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,查尔斯  你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.45,0:33:43.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有人在外面
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.03,0:33:48.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.32,0:33:53.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,是时候该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.12,0:34:49.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,放手
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.77,0:34:53.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,放手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.18,0:34:53.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你得帮他
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.64,0:34:55.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人在水里  救救他
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.04,0:34:58.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,放手吧  你必须得放手
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.39,0:35:21.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,住手  你会淹死的  你必须放手
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.85,0:35:24.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道这对你很重要  但是你会死的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.95,0:35:28.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托了  埃里克  冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.37,0:35:42.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,放开我  放开
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.38,0:35:44.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 冷静  拜托  - 我们在这
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.89,0:35:45.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.62,0:35:47.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,查尔斯·泽维尔教授
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.60,0:35:48.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你侵入我的思想
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.01,0:35:49.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.45,0:35:52.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有超能力  我也有
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.00,0:35:54.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我和你一样  请冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.80,0:36:00.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我以为我是孤身一人  - 你不是一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.08,0:36:05.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克  你不是一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.86,0:36:11.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,(中央情报局秘密研发基地)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.76,0:36:27.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到我的基地
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.32,0:36:30.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的职责是研究
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.66,0:36:33.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,用于军事防御或是进攻的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.36,0:36:34.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.08,0:36:37.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个家伙  尚  施密特
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.20,0:36:38.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管你们怎么称呼他
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.43,0:36:39.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,他和苏联人一起工作
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.25,0:36:41.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要你们的帮助来阻止他们
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.67,0:36:42.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.73,0:36:45.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我们现在是中情局的变种人部门吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.73,0:36:47.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,差不多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.64,0:36:55.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是超音速飞机  是目前最先进的飞机
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.08,0:36:58.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们该见识下它的用途
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.86,0:37:00.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.15,0:37:04.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉克  这些是我和你提过的特殊的新员工
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.30,0:37:05.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是汉克·麦考伊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.33,0:37:07.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,最出色的青年研究员之一
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.40,0:37:11.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,原来这已经有一个厉害的变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.07,0:37:12.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么不说
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.95,0:37:14.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.57,0:37:16.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,原来你不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.79,0:37:20.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我感到非常非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.90,0:37:24.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉克
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.00,0:37:26.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没问  所以我也没说
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.49,0:37:30.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以你的超能力是什么  智商超群吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.96,0:37:33.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来说吧  汉克在十五岁的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.03,0:37:34.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,就以优异的成绩毕业了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.50,0:37:36.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我真希望只是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.33,0:37:39.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是你的朋友  汉克
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.04,0:37:40.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以展现自己的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.03,0:37:58.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.48,0:38:06.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 借过  - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.67,0:38:21.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,你很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.66,0:38:23.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.08,0:38:30.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天苏联外交部长基米柯先生提出警告
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.79,0:38:34.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,美国在土耳其部署导弹
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.42,0:38:37.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,对苏联人民来说意味着空前的威胁
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.22,0:38:39.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,但他同时强调
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.70,0:38:43.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏联不会最先采取军事行动
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.72,0:38:46.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,等我们一到苏联  就能搞定一切
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.67,0:38:48.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,除非中情局在那之前先找到我们
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.13,0:38:50.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也会留心他们的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.56,0:38:54.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果那心灵感应潜入你的思想
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.06,0:38:56.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,他可不会像我这样有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.49,0:38:58.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,已经在我掌控之中了  亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.18,0:39:13.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些苏联人给我造了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.89,0:39:20.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在  我在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.00,0:39:30.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.22,0:39:34.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在想
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.85,0:39:37.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我一生中见过的最美的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.20,0:39:43.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有这里需要加点冰
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.67,0:39:46.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我来点
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.49,0:39:48.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是好姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.57,0:40:16.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,自从我懂事起
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.77,0:40:18.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就发誓要找到治疗的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.69,0:40:22.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不能明白我希望变得...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.72,0:40:23.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 普通  - 普通
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.07,0:40:30.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,查尔斯不会明白
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.62,0:40:34.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,他异于常人  但他不需要隐藏
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.71,0:40:37.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉克  你所制的那些血清
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.43,0:40:39.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会影响超能力对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.87,0:40:42.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是让外表正常
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.03,0:40:43.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.74,0:40:46.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得这对我有用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.13,0:40:49.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你喜欢  我可以继续研究
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.21,0:40:52.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,让你来听了这个奇怪的请求之后
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.03,0:40:53.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,起码我可以为你做这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.12,0:40:54.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我必须得承认
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.97,0:40:57.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,通常男生约我可不会是想抽我的血
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.40,0:41:01.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起  我不是有意冒犯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.46,0:41:03.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是...很激动
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.06,0:41:06.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,你变异的类型
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.39,0:41:09.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的基因可以改变外表
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.98,0:41:11.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉克  你没有冒犯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.87,0:41:14.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然我之前确实有点觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.67,0:41:18.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你之前这么认为我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.35,0:41:19.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,很抱歉误会你了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.59,0:41:23.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧  抽血吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.02,0:41:37.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起  我伤到你了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.18,0:41:41.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,真亲昵啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.64,0:41:44.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,话说
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.10,0:41:48.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我像你那样  我不会改变自己
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.74,0:42:08.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,(塞巴斯汀·尚  118470号档案)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.76,0:42:17.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,以我对你的了解
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.53,0:42:19.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这么快就走实在让我惊讶
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.60,0:42:24.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你了解我什么  - 所有的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.37,0:42:27.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就别侵入我的思想
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.38,0:42:28.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉  埃里克
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.53,0:42:30.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是我看到了尚对你做的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.63,0:42:34.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我感受到你的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.89,0:42:37.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.70,0:42:46.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不需要你的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.95,0:42:49.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,别自欺欺人了  昨晚你就需要我的帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.40,0:42:51.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果没有我你不会安然脱身的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.61,0:42:53.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在你有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.62,0:42:56.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,成为比现在强大许多的你
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.01,0:43:00.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不会阻止你的离开
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.49,0:43:01.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.33,0:43:06.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是我不会
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.79,0:43:11.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,尚有朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.89,0:43:14.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也可以有
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.66,0:43:23.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉克把这个雷达装置改装成了一台发射机
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.68,0:43:26.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以增强脑电波
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.26,0:43:28.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,以此来增强你的心灵感应能力
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.80,0:43:30.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,帮助我们找到更多的变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.90,0:43:32.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还以为他们都被你找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.65,0:43:33.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.10,0:43:36.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你决定留下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.17,0:43:41.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果有新的物种
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.41,0:43:42.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,它应该是被自己的同类发现
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.33,0:43:45.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,查尔斯和我来找新变种人  而不是你们
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.12,0:43:47.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,首先  那是我的机器
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.95,0:43:49.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,第二  也是更重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.06,0:43:50.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是查尔斯的决定
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.77,0:43:53.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,查尔斯不介意中情局的参与  不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.85,0:43:59.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,不  很抱歉  但是  我同意埃里克
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.48,0:44:01.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,该由我们自己来发现他们
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.60,0:44:04.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我不答应呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.32,0:44:07.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就祝你在没有我的情况下
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.73,0:44:08.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,好好利用这个装置
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.57,0:44:24.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我叫它Cerebro
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.47,0:44:27.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是"大脑"的西班牙语说法吗  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.09,0:44:29.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的  这些电极
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.73,0:44:31.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,连接查尔斯和屋顶上的发射机
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.89,0:44:33.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果找到变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.68,0:44:35.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的大脑会通过感应器发出信号
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.92,0:44:38.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后他们所在的地理坐标就会在这显示出来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.81,0:44:40.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你设计的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.62,0:44:41.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.90,0:44:46.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这样子真像个可爱的实验鼠啊  查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.69,0:44:48.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,别损我了  埃里克
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.92,0:44:50.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我曾经也是实验室里的小白鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.33,0:44:51.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我能认出来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.69,0:44:52.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了  很好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.53,0:44:55.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你确定不剃头吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.42,0:44:56.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,别想碰我的头发
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.43,0:45:42.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.81,0:46:01.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,有票子  大帅哥
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.36,0:46:03.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以到包间里享受私人舞蹈
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.53,0:46:09.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们应该知道双人是要付两倍的钱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.57,0:46:12.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,那不重要  虽然我...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.59,0:46:13.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们想看得更多
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.64,0:46:15.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你秀你的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.23,0:46:17.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们就秀我们的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.54,0:46:20.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,宝贝  这可不是这里的规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.18,0:46:25.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 要来点吗  - 乐意之至
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.39,0:46:29.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,该我了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.51,0:46:49.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,给你个不脱衣服的活儿
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.08,0:46:49.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.93,0:46:58.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 要去哪儿  小伙子们  - 弗吉尼亚  里士满
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.33,0:46:59.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,好  这么说你们是要去机场
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.88,0:47:01.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,火车站还是哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.05,0:47:04.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,不  其实我们希望你能带我们回去
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.49,0:47:05.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,那可要六小时车程
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.96,0:47:08.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,那样我们才有足够的时间来聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.40,0:47:13.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,政府到底想要
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.15,0:47:15.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿历克斯·萨默斯这样的人做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.35,0:47:17.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我劝你们别试图把他和别人放在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.40,0:47:21.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我遇到的第一个宁愿要单独监禁的人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.40,0:47:33.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 很神奇是吧  - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.69,0:47:36.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你喜欢鱼  我也喜欢鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.60,0:47:39.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许我们该找个时间出去好好聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.10,0:47:44.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我宁愿和鱼约会
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.08,0:47:51.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你指它们
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.66,0:48:12.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 打扰了  我是埃里克·勒舍尔  - 我是查尔斯·泽维尔
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.72,0:48:13.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,滚你妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.63,0:48:36.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 雷达上什么也没发现  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.79,0:48:38.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 声纳仪呢  - 也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.64,0:48:41.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.31,0:49:01.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,漂亮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.81,0:49:07.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们存在的原因  我们都是原子的产物  宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.55,0:49:09.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有状况了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.42,0:49:11.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个心灵感应者...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.54,0:49:13.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里我本来感觉不到他
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.77,0:49:15.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,好像他的势力范围...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.14,0:49:17.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,...扩大了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.40,0:49:21.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们在招兵买马
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.70,0:49:25.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只管去苏联  我来处理他
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.66,0:49:29.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我总忍不住去想其他人
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.14,0:49:32.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能感应到他们所有的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.77,0:49:35.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以感觉到他们  他们的愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.93,0:49:38.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们的理想  他们的野心
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.17,0:49:41.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克  我们正在做一些难以置信的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.54,0:49:44.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们能帮助他们  - 能吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.01,0:49:49.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,验明身份  那是第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.53,0:49:54.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,之后就是集中  测试  淘汰
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.36,0:49:55.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道那些
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.28,0:50:00.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有共同的敌人  对付尚和那些苏联人
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.22,0:50:01.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,目前看来是的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.11,0:50:08.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得想想代号了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.88,0:50:11.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在是政府特工人员  得有个机密代号
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.44,0:50:12.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想叫魔形
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.94,0:50:15.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会吧  我还想叫魔形呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.68,0:50:17.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉了  我定了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.11,0:50:22.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还真神秘
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.36,0:50:25.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,达尔文  你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.78,0:50:27.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,其实达尔文就是个绰号
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.83,0:50:31.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,适应的一种方式而已  适者生存嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.48,0:50:33.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,来看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.40,0:50:49.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢  - 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.92,0:50:52.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那你呢  - 我想叫...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.21,0:50:54.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,海妖
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.84,0:50:57.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,干吗起个代表恐怖哭声的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.09,0:50:58.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们大概需要捂上耳朵了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.60,0:51:15.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,轮到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.21,0:51:20.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的艺名是天使  也是适应生存
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.04,0:51:23.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你会飞  - 是的  还会这个
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.68,0:51:36.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么  - 大脚怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.33,0:51:38.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道别人怎么说大脚吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.16,0:51:41.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有  你的脚够小的了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.52,0:51:42.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.90,0:51:46.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿历克斯  你的天赋呢  你能做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.27,0:51:50.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能表演
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.56,0:51:52.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不能在这里表演  - 在外面行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.76,0:51:55.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 去外面不就行了  - 来一个  阿历克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.76,0:52:00.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿历克斯! 阿历克斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.09,0:52:03.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,这才对
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.53,0:52:05.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说趴下你们就趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.15,0:52:13.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,退回去
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.30,0:52:20.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,退回去
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.93,0:52:22.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管你们了...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.19,0:52:38.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得到消息称尚准备
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.56,0:52:41.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,在莫斯科会见苏联国防部长
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.42,0:52:43.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,继续说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.72,0:52:45.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不是来说"早告诉过你"的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.39,0:52:46.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道我来干吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.11,0:52:49.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,是  是  是  清理地方发展你的变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.07,0:52:50.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,以毒攻毒
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.19,0:52:52.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,有点意思
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.55,0:52:54.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等  你觉得这样好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.49,0:52:57.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,派遣一帮没训练没授权的怪胎
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.38,0:53:01.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些"怪胎"都是辛勤工作的人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.66,0:53:04.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞机一小时后去苏联
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.47,0:53:06.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些孩子们还没准备好对付尚
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.49,0:53:07.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想他们会给你惊喜的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.60,0:53:09.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们可不是一般的年轻人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.36,0:53:10.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.82,0:53:23.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,用力
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.70,0:53:25.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,用力
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.72,0:53:30.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们在干吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.36,0:53:38.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谁弄坏了雕像  - 阿历克斯干的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.51,0:53:43.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,是蹂躏者  他的新名字  蹂躏者
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.11,0:53:46.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还想  你应该叫X教授
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.11,0:53:49.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就叫万磁王好了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.43,0:53:51.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,真不一般
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.24,0:53:57.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我对你们很失望
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.80,0:54:03.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,(苏联军事避难所)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.00,0:54:19.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,有麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.97,0:54:22.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么  - 不好意思  地图上没标这个
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.97,0:54:30.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管发生什么  自然点
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.73,0:54:31.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会处理好的  没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.83,0:54:34.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在听我的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.88,0:54:38.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.27,0:54:40.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.84,0:54:43.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,打开车厢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.10,0:54:45.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的  好的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.24,0:54:52.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,放松  放松  伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.82,0:55:09.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,后面有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.27,0:55:10.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么都没  空的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.90,0:55:15.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没有问题了吗  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.62,0:55:40.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 尚在哪  - 是艾玛
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.21,0:55:44.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,她也是个心灵感应者  我的感应会被她发现
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.77,0:55:47.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我试试别的途径
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.01,0:56:07.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,尚让我道歉  他不舒服来不了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.72,0:56:09.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,他让我代替他
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.17,0:56:13.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过就我看  我俩会相处更好
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.73,0:56:15.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.19,0:56:22.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,他没来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.95,0:56:29.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 头儿  现在怎么办  - 什么也不办  我们等的是尚
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.26,0:56:30.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 任务流产  - 狗屁任务
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.64,0:56:33.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 埃里克  - 她是他的得力助手
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.00,0:56:34.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,对我来说已经不错了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.42,0:56:37.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,中情特工袭击高级苏联官员的住所
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.23,0:56:39.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你疯了  - 我可不是中情特工
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.77,0:56:41.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.67,0:56:45.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,祝你健康
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.45,0:56:52.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么您一定正忙于采取下一步行动
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.71,0:56:53.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,贵国如何应对
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.54,0:56:55.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,美国拒绝从土耳其撤出其导弹
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.85,0:57:00.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能透露这些机密  弗罗斯特小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.61,0:57:01.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,叫我艾玛
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.27,0:57:09.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心  您什么都不用说
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.85,0:57:27.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,他准备一手策划第三次世界大战吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.92,0:57:29.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们得做点什么  - 比如说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.90,0:57:31.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 开始行动  - 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.37,0:57:49.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起  我不能让他自己干
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.55,0:58:03.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,看在上帝的份上  埃里克
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.98,0:58:04.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.00,0:58:07.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,冷静  忘了我  对了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.80,0:58:15.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真美  真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.17,0:58:23.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,可怜虫
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.75,0:58:36.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,好魔术
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.17,0:58:40.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.88,0:58:45.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,睡觉去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.85,0:58:56.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,别试着读我的思想了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.43,0:59:01.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我变成这样的时候你什么也读不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.18,0:59:15.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你就用嘴说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.13,0:59:19.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,尚在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.96,0:59:26.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.97,0:59:35.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克  可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.75,0:59:45.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克  可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.99,0:59:56.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.67,1:00:00.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,她变不了钻石体了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.75,1:00:04.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果还变  敲她一下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.33,1:00:12.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,(美利坚合众国)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.57,1:00:15.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,(古巴)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.50,1:00:18.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,(美国)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.43,1:00:23.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,(苏联)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.10,1:00:31.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都是原子的产物
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.34,1:00:34.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,辐射给了变种人生命
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.40,1:00:39.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,让人类致命的东西只会让我们更强大
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.15,1:00:45.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,很漂亮  是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.59,1:00:50.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,比我们预计的更糟
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.63,1:00:54.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们带你一起走
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.36,1:00:58.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 中情局想亲自问你  - 他们行吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.27,1:01:01.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,或许现在不用担心这个问题
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.71,1:01:09.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,不错哦
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.14,1:01:12.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,上帝啊  你杀了我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.42,1:01:14.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,别虐待自己了  我们有大把时间
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.06,1:01:22.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,原来马戏团竟然在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.45,1:01:24.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧  宝贝  让我们看看
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.19,1:01:27.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧  让我们看看你的脚
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.04,1:01:29.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧  来吧  大脚  来一个
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.98,1:01:32.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,别这样嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.54,1:01:38.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们只是蠢货而已
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.39,1:01:41.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能忍受蠢货  多久都能忍
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.98,1:01:43.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是我宁愿有一帮家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.10,1:01:44.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,盯着我脱衣服
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.29,1:01:46.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,也不愿意他们像这样看我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.64,1:01:48.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,看我们
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.89,1:01:57.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么状况
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.54,1:02:02.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道  但是感觉不妙
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.59,1:02:14.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 还没有尚的消息  - 一点都没
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.08,1:02:15.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,秘密渠道一点消息都没有
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.81,1:02:29.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.32,1:02:49.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,主厅有入侵者
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.40,1:02:50.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,变种人在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.38,1:02:52.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,动一动  我就开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.14,1:02:54.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,你开吧  不过先告诉我去哪找那些高等人类
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.50,1:02:57.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,请速支援
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.74,1:03:03.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,退后  退后  待在房里  我们遭到袭击
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.73,1:03:05.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 小心  - 开枪  开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.34,1:03:20.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,变种人呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.70,1:03:23.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,把人放下  否则开火
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.49,1:03:51.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,待在这里才怪  快跑
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.50,1:03:59.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 回去  - 我们能帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.92,1:05:00.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等  你找变种人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.81,1:05:01.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们就在那扇门里
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.93,1:05:03.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,放过我们普通人吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.51,1:05:04.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不会...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.99,1:05:15.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个心灵感应者呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.72,1:05:17.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不在这里  - 真糟
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.55,1:05:20.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我就能把这该死的东西去掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.60,1:05:25.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,晚上好  我是塞巴斯汀·尚
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.72,1:05:30.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你们
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.09,1:05:31.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.78,1:05:32.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿撒佐恶魔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.77,1:05:39.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙伴们  革命马上就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.44,1:05:43.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,当人类发现我们  我们的能力
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.96,1:05:45.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都将面对一个选择
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.39,1:05:50.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,被奴役  还是反过来统治世界
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.91,1:05:54.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,随你选  但是如果你不与我们同行
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.38,1:05:58.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,就意味着和我们为敌
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.83,1:06:01.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以  你可以待着不动
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.51,1:06:04.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,为那些憎恶害怕你们的人类而战
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.68,1:06:09.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,或者是加入我  如王者般活着
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.01,1:06:17.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,或像王后
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.97,1:06:30.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 天使  - 不是开玩笑吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.57,1:06:34.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,得了吧  我们不属于这里
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.46,1:06:37.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,没什么好惭愧的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.66,1:06:44.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得采取行动了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.78,1:07:02.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等  我加入
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.55,1:07:07.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,选得好
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.31,1:07:11.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的变种能力是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.05,1:07:13.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,为生存而适应
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.22,1:07:20.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我算是加入了吧  - 不错
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.30,1:07:29.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 阿历克斯  开始  - 趴下
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.15,1:07:37.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,保护你的伙伴吗  变种人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.43,1:07:41.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,姿势挺帅  感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.57,1:07:49.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,适应这个试试
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.63,1:08:23.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,(苏联  莫斯科)
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.26,1:08:34.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.39,1:08:39.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,对于美国中情局所作的一切
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.57,1:08:44.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,再次对您表示深切的同情
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.41,1:08:46.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些美国人太残忍了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.06,1:08:51.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在他们又在土耳其部署导弹
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.45,1:08:57.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望你正在策划的新导弹基地
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.00,1:08:58.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,选在那些
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.15,1:09:02.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,美国预警系统
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.76,1:09:04.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,涉及不到的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.14,1:09:09.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,听说古巴这个季节不错
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.84,1:09:12.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,离佛罗里达还挺近
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.52,1:09:15.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,在古巴部署导弹
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.65,1:09:18.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不是开玩笑吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.04,1:09:22.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,那还不如直接宣战呢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.93,1:09:26.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能我没说清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.62,1:09:30.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会让这些发生的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.03,1:09:33.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.74,1:09:37.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,听听克格勃怎么说吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.84,1:09:44.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好  我是沃尔科夫将军
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.14,1:09:49.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.02,1:10:06.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞雯
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.32,1:10:15.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们安排你们立即回家
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.35,1:10:17.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们不回家  - 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.64,1:10:20.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他不要回监狱  - 他们杀了达尔文
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.90,1:10:22.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,让你们离开有诸多原因
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.58,1:10:23.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,一切都结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.85,1:10:27.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,达尔文死了  查尔斯  我们甚至没法安葬他
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.69,1:10:32.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以替他报仇
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.77,1:10:37.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克  借一步说话
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.07,1:10:43.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们还是孩子  - 不  他们曾是孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.25,1:10:46.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,尚有自己的部队  我们也需要
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.58,1:10:55.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要特训  所有人
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.47,1:10:58.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好吗  - 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.20,1:11:00.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不能待在这里了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.16,1:11:03.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,哪怕重建也不安全
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.61,1:11:06.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们无处可去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.02,1:11:10.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.21,1:11:13.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,依律我们得策反她
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.28,1:11:15.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,法律是针对人类的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.59,1:11:18.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,人类法律约束不了变种人  他们太危险了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.96,1:11:22.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,非常时期  安全比自由重要的多
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.17,1:11:28.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 战争快爆发了  约翰  - 是啊  和谁打
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.04,1:11:43.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,问得好
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.26,1:11:46.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然我不太确定该不该叫它战争
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.10,1:11:50.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为那个词表明两方势均力敌
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.32,1:12:02.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰长  没有任何美舰的迹象
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.75,1:12:05.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,保持航线  全速前进
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.08,1:12:08.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏联佬已经把弹头拉到古巴了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.02,1:12:11.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们的船还有一周登陆
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.37,1:12:13.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,当苏联佬的船抵达时
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.43,1:12:15.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的舰队可以布置在这一线
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.28,1:12:18.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果他们越过这条线
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.43,1:12:21.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是在和美国宣战
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.42,1:12:23.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,到时我们就别无选择
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.54,1:12:25.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,只能进行报复性的核回应了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.19,1:12:27.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,通过吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.63,1:12:34.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,派遣第七舰队
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.30,1:12:41.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是你的  - 是咱们的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.30,1:12:50.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,说实在的查尔斯  我不知道你怎么养家糊口的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.64,1:12:52.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,生活得水深火热
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.47,1:12:55.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,那水深火热已经被我缓和了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.18,1:13:00.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧  参观时间
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.96,1:13:10.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,(苏联  莫斯科)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.02,1:13:14.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的同志们
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.99,1:13:17.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,美国政府
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.91,1:13:22.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,已经派遣战舰到古巴
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.12,1:13:27.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,这使我们没有退路
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.38,1:13:31.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,首席大臣同志
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.53,1:13:35.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须派出我们的舰队
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.37,1:13:40.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,调遣舰队
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.05,1:13:49.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,肯尼迪总统签署正式公告
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.84,1:13:49.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.09,1:13:52.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,对古巴进行全面武装封锁
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.84,1:13:53.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.84,1:13:56.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,作为回应  苏联提出这一举动
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.28,1:14:00.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,将成为热核战争的导火线
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.27,1:14:04.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,(《纽约论坛报》  核战迫在眉睫)
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.53,1:14:13.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真要这么干吗  - 来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.94,1:14:14.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,稳住
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.02,1:14:24.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行  我做不到  抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.34,1:14:25.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,这么近的距离  我没办法开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.72,1:14:26.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,况且还是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.75,1:14:28.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,怕什么  你知道我能搞定的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.62,1:14:30.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是你一直叫我对自己狠点儿吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.19,1:14:31.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要是确信搞得定它
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.47,1:14:33.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,就不算自我挑战了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.06,1:14:36.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,曾经某人想举起潜水艇
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.07,1:14:37.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,结果怎么样来着
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.75,1:14:39.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我移不动它
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.69,1:14:43.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,它太大  得是怒火中烧我才搞得定
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.38,1:14:44.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,不对  光有怒气可不顶用
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.64,1:14:47.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直都靠怒气过关斩将
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.49,1:14:49.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,每次它都让你濒临绝境
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.57,1:14:51.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,来这边
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.55,1:14:54.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,来试点儿更有挑战性的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.13,1:14:59.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的继父觉得核战一触即发
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.40,1:15:00.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,走这边
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.48,1:15:02.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以他在这儿建了地堡
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.85,1:15:05.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以在这里做些训练
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.39,1:15:06.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,墙不会被我轰塌了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.15,1:15:09.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会  这地方能抵得住核弹
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.87,1:15:11.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以接得住你的招  阿历克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.51,1:15:13.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,每次我出手  总是没什么好事儿
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.30,1:15:15.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,是因为你不能收放自如
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.87,1:15:17.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,你受制于自己的能力
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.32,1:15:21.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以你需要训练  阿历克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.08,1:15:27.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的能力超乎寻常
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.57,1:15:30.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的音调与玻璃的共振频率达到了一致
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.58,1:15:31.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以它碎了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.66,1:15:33.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,声带无异于体内其他肌肉
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.15,1:15:35.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能控制自己发出的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.42,1:15:40.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,"每个人都徘徊在善恶之间"
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.37,1:15:42.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗伯特·路易斯·史蒂文森在"化身博士"中的独白
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.11,1:15:43.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,答对了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.35,1:15:45.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,其实也不关善恶的事  对吧  汉克
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.41,1:15:48.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,讲得是人的兽性  和他抵抗兽性
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.63,1:15:49.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,最终遵从兽性
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.87,1:15:52.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是这种摇摆不定束缚了你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.58,1:15:55.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,化身博士害怕自己的能力
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.26,1:15:56.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也是一样
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.97,1:15:58.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是非要我在这儿练习
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.30,1:15:59.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你最好找个地方先躲起来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.69,1:16:03.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 必须的  用不用关门  - 关上吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.01,1:16:07.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好了就开始吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.88,1:16:16.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.50,1:16:21.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会教你收放自如  阿历克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.22,1:16:27.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你确定这玩意能用吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.38,1:16:29.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,一切皆有可能  这个设计是按照...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.49,1:16:31.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉克  别聊了  快点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.96,1:16:33.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,记住  往死了喊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.97,1:16:35.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,想要超音速飞行就靠你自制音波了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.84,1:16:37.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,对准角度的话  应该能飞起来
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.33,1:16:41.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,"应该能飞起来"  还真让人安心
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.38,1:16:43.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.98,1:16:45.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,别忘了大声喊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.21,1:16:58.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,这次要是想跑过我  得释放你的兽性
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.23,1:17:04.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,各就各位  预备...开始
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.57,1:17:21.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,祝贺你  哥们
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.45,1:17:23.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗伯特·路易斯·史蒂文森会为你自豪的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.24,1:17:26.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮  汉克
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.84,1:17:27.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,有那样的脚
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.49,1:17:28.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,再加个红鼻头就可以去拉雪橇了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.99,1:17:30.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说对吧  傻大个儿
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.77,1:17:31.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿没我的事儿了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.59,1:17:32.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,真会帮倒忙  阿历克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.94,1:17:35.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来  汉克
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.04,1:17:49.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你光顾着掩饰自己的不同
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.26,1:17:52.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,就没办法做好该做的事了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.67,1:17:55.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,只想给你些保命忠告
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.62,1:18:01.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想要社会接受你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.37,1:18:04.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,可你自己都不肯接受
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.96,1:18:12.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,帅气
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.13,1:18:14.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,这还是半成品
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.16,1:18:16.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,成品是一整套  更有看头
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.66,1:18:19.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些探测器能检测你发出能量的大小
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.04,1:18:21.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,这块嵌板能集中能量并将多余的吸收掉
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.74,1:18:23.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了  试试打中间那个靶子
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.05,1:18:24.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,就中间那个  小心点儿
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.98,1:18:26.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.33,1:18:37.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,快来看看
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.23,1:18:39.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的基因很特殊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.16,1:18:41.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,细胞老化速度是常人的一半
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.23,1:18:43.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,等你四十岁了  还会是年轻人的模样
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.90,1:18:47.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我见过的最非凡的细胞结构
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.67,1:18:54.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,你确定这回我飞得起来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.66,1:18:56.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,确信无疑
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.35,1:18:57.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我相信你  - 先完成任务
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.80,1:18:59.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不相信他  - 你什么也别说
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.73,1:19:01.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要死了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.99,1:19:03.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事  要是不想做的话
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.59,1:19:04.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不会逼你的...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.60,1:19:08.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 过来  我来帮你  - 埃里克
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.80,1:19:30.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.28,1:19:33.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不也是这么想的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.95,1:19:35.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,太棒了  汉克  非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.65,1:19:37.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了  阿历克斯  射中X
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.07,1:19:40.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,尽量别射我  好孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.65,1:19:43.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 玩真的吗  - 非常认真
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.72,1:19:46.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我对你绝对有信心
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.81,1:19:59.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在还说我傻吗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.94,1:20:02.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,对  汉克  你还是傻大个儿
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.54,1:20:04.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是衣服做得不错
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.84,1:20:09.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,看见那个没
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.61,1:20:11.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,试试把它转向我们
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.70,1:20:32.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得关键在于
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.71,1:20:36.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,愤怒与平静之间的某个点
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.76,1:20:40.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,介不介意我...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.98,1:21:15.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你刚才把我怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.08,1:21:20.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我进入了你记忆系统里最光明的部分
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.47,1:21:25.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是美好的记忆  埃里克  谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.88,1:21:28.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我都不知道自己还记得那些
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.86,1:21:31.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有很多你自己没察觉的记忆存在
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.59,1:21:33.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,不光是痛苦和愤怒
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.86,1:21:37.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,也有好的事物  我感觉到了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.67,1:21:40.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,等你能回忆起全部的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.09,1:21:43.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就会所向披靡
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.97,1:21:45.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,无人能敌
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.18,1:21:49.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以再来  再试试
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.79,1:22:31.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,干得好
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.08,1:22:34.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,总统演说马上要开始了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.06,1:22:37.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,国家政策上来讲
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.58,1:22:40.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,任何越过古巴禁运线的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.30,1:22:43.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,核导弹行动
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.89,1:22:47.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,都应被视为苏联对美国发起的进攻
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.14,1:22:52.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,对此美方应予以全力反击
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.17,1:22:54.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 尚就在那里  - 你怎么知道
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.52,1:22:55.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,两个超级大国展开对峙
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.73,1:22:57.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,而他想挑起第三次世界大战
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.25,1:23:00.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不会错过这个良机
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.11,1:23:01.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,外交话题到此为止
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.59,1:23:04.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家还是为明天做好准备吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.79,1:23:06.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,...最终导致战争
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.46,1:23:11.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏联船只靠近古巴使两国关系更加紧张
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.90,1:23:16.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有避免核战的外交尝试均以失败告终
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.75,1:23:18.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,美方已做好准备
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.90,1:23:21.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,迎接可能到来的原子突击
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.25,1:23:24.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,全国上下人心惶惶
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.52,1:23:26.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,超市被抢售一空
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.34,1:23:29.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,二战之后就未经使用过的避难所
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.23,1:23:31.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,到了派上用场的时刻
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.82,1:23:36.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,美方遭遇到前所未有的巨大威胁
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.48,1:23:40.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,战争就要降临  且没人能阻挡我
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.14,1:23:47.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,进来
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.22,1:23:51.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,给你个惊喜
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.64,1:24:03.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我分离了你的DNA样本中相应的部分
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.26,1:24:06.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,这血清跟抗生素的原理一样
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.26,1:24:09.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,会攻击引发我们外表异变的细胞
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.46,1:24:11.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,它只对你的外貌有效  不会影响能力
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.87,1:24:16.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还想变成普通人的样子吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.95,1:24:20.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们一定要隐藏吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.36,1:24:22.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你已经藏起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.34,1:24:26.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,此刻的你就像我一直那样  掩藏自己
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.99,1:24:29.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想一直像个怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.51,1:24:31.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我只想看起来...- 普通人
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.66,1:24:32.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.90,1:24:41.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉克  不要改变自己
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.23,1:24:44.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你很美  汉克
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.84,1:24:47.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的一切都很美  你是完美的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.16,1:24:53.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看我们大家  想想这星期的训练成果
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.54,1:24:55.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有我们将会达成的一切
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.75,1:24:58.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们与众不同
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.40,1:25:02.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是我们不该费力气去融入社会
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.83,1:25:05.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,社会应该向我们靠拢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.83,1:25:10.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,突变  自豪
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.98,1:25:16.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我应当告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.63,1:25:18.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,就算明天我们拯救了世界
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.94,1:25:21.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,变种人被社会接纳
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.20,1:25:25.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的脚和你的蓝皮肤
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.96,1:25:28.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,永远不会被认为是美的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.37,1:25:35.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在你看上去很美
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.75,1:25:40.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要这一针
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.87,1:26:11.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,古巴 俄罗斯 美国 没什么区别
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.31,1:26:15.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,尚在向全人类宣战  向我们宣战
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.71,1:26:17.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,必须阻止他
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.31,1:26:19.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不准备阻止尚
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.51,1:26:21.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要杀了他.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.81,1:26:26.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,这步你想到了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.12,1:26:35.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我加入的目的你最清楚  查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.87,1:26:37.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,但事出有变
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.18,1:26:40.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,本来这是秘密任务
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.47,1:26:43.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,但明天变种人将会为世人所知
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.48,1:26:46.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,尚和我们...在他们眼里没有区别
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.31,1:26:50.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们会惧怕我们  而恐惧会变成怨恨
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.22,1:26:53.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,除非我们阻止战争  阻止尚
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.63,1:26:55.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,拼上我们的性命
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.71,1:26:56.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们会为我们出生入死吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.79,1:26:58.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,能力越大  责任越大
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.78,1:27:00.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们做得够好了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.76,1:27:02.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是人类进化的下一阶段
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.54,1:27:04.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你自己都说过  - 够了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.64,1:27:06.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真的幼稚到以为
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.50,1:27:09.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们不会为自己的生存反击我们吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.73,1:27:13.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 还是你太过自负了  - 你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.29,1:27:16.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,明天过后他们的矛头会转向我们
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.28,1:27:17.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,而你却视而不见
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.40,1:27:19.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,只因为你觉得他们都像莫伊洛一样
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.82,1:27:21.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,而你觉得他们都像尚一样
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.14,1:27:27.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,仔细听我说  朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.27,1:27:31.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀了尚不会让你得到安慰
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.00,1:27:35.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀他并不是为了平复内心
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.63,1:28:22.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.01,1:28:26.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.79,1:28:56.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.24,1:28:59.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,吓我一跳
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.06,1:29:01.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是惊吓吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.32,1:29:06.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,是惊喜  瑞雯  你怎么不睡觉
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.95,1:29:08.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,过几年再来勾引我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.26,1:29:14.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在不好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.97,1:29:21.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢真实的你
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.41,1:29:28.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说的是  真实的你
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.94,1:29:39.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,完美绝伦
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.69,1:29:47.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 把浴袍给我好吗  - 你不必隐藏
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.01,1:29:53.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以前看到老虎
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.56,1:29:55.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,会想要把它藏起来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.92,1:29:59.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会  可是...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.84,1:30:01.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你完美无瑕  瑞雯
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.50,1:30:06.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是生活试图把你驯服
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.86,1:30:08.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你解放自己的时候了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.24,1:30:31.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,有时我想  如果那晚
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.24,1:30:33.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没发现我的话  我的生活会是如何
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.80,1:30:36.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.48,1:30:39.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,天哪  瑞雯
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.41,1:30:41.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的衣服呢  快穿上
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.93,1:30:44.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,第一次见面时你可不是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.43,1:30:47.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是小时候比较可爱吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.12,1:30:50.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞雯  我不知道你最近是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.37,1:30:51.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以为你心情挺好的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.41,1:30:55.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉克告诉我他能处理
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.24,1:30:57.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你外表的问题
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.57,1:31:00.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我谈谈是怎么回事儿
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.88,1:31:02.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是我得用上读心术
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.21,1:31:04.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,你答应过不会对我用的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.14,1:31:06.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,以前不用超能力
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.48,1:31:08.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也能知道你的想法  瑞雯
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.69,1:31:10.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,查尔斯  我原以为你会跟我
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.75,1:31:12.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,一起对抗这个世界
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.49,1:31:14.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,可是不管这个世界变得多糟
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.12,1:31:16.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你都不想与之抗衡  是不是
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.10,1:31:17.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想要成为它的一份子
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.64,1:31:40.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里究竟发生什么了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.43,1:31:50.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉克没歇着
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.24,1:31:52.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们真得穿成这样吗
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.51,1:31:56.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,既然我们忍受不了极度重力
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.38,1:31:59.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,也不能挡子弹  还是穿上比较保险
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.12,1:32:25.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉克哪儿去了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.14,1:32:28.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.19,1:32:39.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉克
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.04,1:32:47.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,血清没有攻击那些细胞
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.35,1:32:49.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,反倒加强了它们
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.74,1:32:52.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,没起作用
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.52,1:32:55.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,它起作用了  汉克
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.43,1:32:59.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,没看出来吗  你就该这样
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.35,1:33:01.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,这才是你
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.72,1:33:05.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,别再隐藏了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.95,1:33:07.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,棒透了  哥们
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.11,1:33:08.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉克
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.17,1:33:12.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,不许笑话我
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.80,1:33:14.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉克  立刻放他下来  别闹了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.52,1:33:15.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉克...汉克
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.67,1:33:20.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说的实话
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.52,1:33:22.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得说  你看上去确实像个大反角
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.79,1:33:26.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我给你想到个新名字  野兽
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.67,1:33:30.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你确定能开飞机吗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.52,1:33:33.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,废话  飞机是我造的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.33,1:33:39.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,(古巴)
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.93,1:33:46.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,货船状况如何
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.83,1:33:49.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,正对方向  十二海里位置
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.17,1:33:54.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,距抵达禁运线还有三分钟  长官
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.63,1:33:57.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们要是越线就自求多福吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.03,1:34:01.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,愿上帝保佑
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.03,1:34:03.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,发起战斗警报
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.18,1:34:05.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,战斗警报  战斗警报
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.57,1:34:08.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 全体进入战备状态  - 是的  长官
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.32,1:34:10.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,待命准备
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.80,1:34:12.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,战斗警报  战斗警报
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.97,1:34:25.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,船长  我们已经得到指令了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.81,1:34:28.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么还盼着新的命令
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.08,1:34:32.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我经历过一场战争  同志
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.98,1:34:36.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想再起争端
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.55,1:34:40.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,立刻进入战备状态
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.59,1:34:48.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,炮手瞄准正前方货船
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.50,1:34:53.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰队报告  全部武装待命
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.71,1:34:55.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,克里姆林宫来的消息  长官
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.31,1:34:57.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,新指令  十点二十五分之前
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.78,1:35:00.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,特命咸海号货船...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.33,1:35:03.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,...改变航向返回敖德萨
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.62,1:35:05.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,咸海号  请回答
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.79,1:35:07.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,咸海号  请回答
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.15,1:35:09.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们没有回复
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.56,1:35:11.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,船只没有掉头
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.14,1:35:13.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,咸海号  命令你原地返回
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.77,1:35:15.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要越过警戒线
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.44,1:35:17.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,目标已被瞄准  长官
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.37,1:35:20.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 预备射击  - 待命  长官
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.91,1:35:35.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,那边看起来一团糟
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.30,1:35:49.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,咸海号  命令你原地返回
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.49,1:35:53.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,咸海号船员全都死了  尚去过那里
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.07,1:35:54.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,他还在
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.84,1:35:56.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,他把船驶向了禁航线
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.61,1:35:58.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,这艘船只一旦过线  就会遭受我方轰炸
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.35,1:36:00.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,战争就会开始
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.40,1:36:03.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,除非他们不在船上
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.01,1:36:08.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,美方独立舰  我是亚历山大·诺维茨基
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.74,1:36:10.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们失去了对我方货船的控制
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.81,1:36:13.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,已经命令它返航  不要开火
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.60,1:36:15.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,重复  不要开火
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.43,1:36:17.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏军已要求己方货船返航  长官
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.75,1:36:22.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是诡计  不用理会  预备开火
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.83,1:36:25.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 预备开火  长官  - 听我倒数
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.57,1:36:27.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,五  四
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.66,1:36:52.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓紧  抓紧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.37,1:37:02.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.01,1:37:09.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事  - 那些苏联人
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.01,1:37:10.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们向自己的船开火
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.19,1:37:13.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,下次提前打个招呼  教授
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.31,1:37:14.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起啊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.33,1:37:15.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧  - 还好
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.68,1:37:17.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,搞什么
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.44,1:37:21.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,让辛克莱接电话  我要一套新的部署
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.69,1:37:27.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,恭喜你  同志
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.51,1:37:31.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你刚刚让我们避免了一场核战争
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.62,1:37:33.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.11,1:37:34.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,把他带到禁闭室
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.72,1:37:36.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么  发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.63,1:37:40.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们说那个人失去意识了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.73,1:37:42.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,美国人耍花招
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.45,1:37:45.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们来了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.60,1:37:47.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,心灵感应很强烈了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.04,1:37:51.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们开始后备计划
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.65,1:37:56.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 太振奋人心了  查尔斯  - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.87,1:37:58.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我仍然无法定位尚
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.26,1:38:00.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,他就在下面  我们现在就要找到他
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.79,1:38:01.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉克
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.57,1:38:06.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 雷达上显示什么异常了吗  - 没有
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.71,1:38:08.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,那他一定在水下
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.47,1:38:10.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,很显然我们没有声纳
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.47,1:38:13.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,不  我们有
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.35,1:38:15.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.83,1:38:20.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们为战争做好准备了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.16,1:38:23.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们只需要用另一根火柴点燃导火线
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.98,1:38:26.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们仍会有世上最强大的武器
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.48,1:38:28.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就是我
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.90,1:38:30.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我吸收核反应堆100%的能量输出
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.38,1:38:34.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,这之间我不能被打扰
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.27,1:38:39.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉克  把这该死的飞机拉平
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.81,1:38:46.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也要来
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.83,1:38:49.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,野兽  把底仓门打开
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.33,1:39:02.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,记住  这只是块肌肉  你能控制它
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.61,1:39:06.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,就这么想  我们一会儿见
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.98,1:39:13.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,听我命令  3  2  1  走
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.28,1:39:31.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,警告舰队  他们想把他们的监控摘下来
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.00,1:39:46.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,海妖发现尚的位置了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.51,1:39:50.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.15,1:39:52.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们去找他吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.16,1:40:23.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,(反应堆能量指示)
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.17,1:41:00.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,记住  关键在于愤怒与平静之间的某个点
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.38,1:42:25.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克  抓着我的手
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.45,1:42:30.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓紧了伙计们  要开始颠簸了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.56,1:42:47.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克  抓着我的手
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.30,1:43:22.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,下来
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.17,1:43:41.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 莫伊洛  你还好吧  - 没事
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.94,1:43:47.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我进入了守门人的思想
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.85,1:43:49.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,尚正在抽取潜水艇中所有的能量
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.86,1:43:49.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.01,1:43:51.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,他要把自己变成一枚核弹
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.18,1:43:54.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们没时间了  盖革计数器快超量程了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.43,1:43:55.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的莫伊洛  接下来我们
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.46,1:43:57.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,用步话机通知双方的舰队迅速撤离
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.28,1:43:58.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要进去了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.92,1:44:00.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,野兽  蹂躏者  掩护他
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.68,1:44:02.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克  你进去后听我指示
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.82,1:44:05.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过你要扫清阻碍我的障碍
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.34,1:44:07.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,剩下就只能祈祷为时不晚
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.40,1:44:08.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 搞定  - 祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.32,1:44:11.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 瑞雯  停下  - 我要出去
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.41,1:44:12.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,没时间玩这个
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.34,1:44:14.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看着门口  以防外人进去
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.68,1:44:16.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.94,1:44:33.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,野兽
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.77,1:44:39.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,大不了同归于尽
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.83,1:44:45.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们认为尚正试着引爆一种炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.35,1:44:52.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克  到船的中间去
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.03,1:44:54.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,那里我的思想无法进入
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.55,1:44:56.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们假设尚就在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.79,1:45:07.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,不许动  不许动
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.69,1:45:17.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是核反应堆  破坏它
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.75,1:45:31.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,住手  不要动
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.39,1:45:40.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,蹲下
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.21,1:46:05.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克你到了中部  那里没人
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.87,1:46:07.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不在这里  查尔斯  尚不在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.71,1:46:10.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他离开潜艇了  - 什么  他肯定在
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.17,1:46:12.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,他一定在  不会去别的地方  再找找
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.46,1:46:15.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说了他不在  这里没人  该死
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.05,1:46:22.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克  真是个惊喜啊
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.86,1:46:24.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克  埃里克
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.26,1:46:28.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,再次见到你真好
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.64,1:46:47.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能问你些问题吗
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.86,1:46:50.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么在他们那边
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.76,1:46:51.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他消失了  - 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.84,1:46:54.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,他进入盲区了  我联系不到他
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.07,1:46:57.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么要为即将灭亡的种族战斗
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.71,1:46:59.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,人类一旦发现气数已尽
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.27,1:47:00.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,就会将我们赶尽杀绝
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.26,1:47:46.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我对军营里发生事道歉
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.46,1:47:49.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是真心的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.64,1:47:59.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,又找到他了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.01,1:48:03.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克  继续  起作用了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.23,1:48:07.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我做的每一件事都是为了你
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.59,1:48:11.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,开启并让你拥有超能力
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.02,1:48:16.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,很有效
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.25,1:48:18.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能看到他了  但我不能看到他的思想
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.93,1:48:35.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,从弯曲的铁门  你一路走来
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.03,1:48:37.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我为你感到骄傲
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.59,1:48:48.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还要走很长的路
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.47,1:48:52.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,想想我们能一起走多远
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.26,1:49:14.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,住手  阿撒佐恶魔
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.47,1:49:32.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想伤害你  埃里克  我从没有过
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.90,1:49:34.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想帮助你
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.33,1:49:37.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我们的时刻  我们的时代
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.62,1:49:41.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是人类的未来
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.01,1:49:47.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和我  孩子  这世界是我们的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.70,1:49:52.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你做的每件事  都使我更坚强
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.58,1:49:56.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,把我变成今天强大的我
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.82,1:50:00.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,说的没错
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.67,1:50:03.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直都明白
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.77,1:50:11.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我的造物主
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.57,1:50:13.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是现在  查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.66,1:50:16.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.63,1:50:19.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,莫伊洛安静点  我只能控制这家伙一会
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.87,1:50:34.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起  查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.13,1:50:36.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克  做个好人  你已经...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.50,1:50:37.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,可我不相信你
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.30,1:50:38.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克  这样没法知道...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.91,1:50:41.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.86,1:50:44.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 查尔斯  - 别这么做  埃里克
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.01,1:50:54.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你能听到  我希望你知道
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.72,1:50:56.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我同意你说的每一句话
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.21,1:51:00.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是未来
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.50,1:51:04.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.31,1:51:09.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,很不幸  你杀了我妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.05,1:51:20.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,接下来我把硬币还给你
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.83,1:51:22.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要  埃里克  别
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.13,1:51:26.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我数到三  我就要移动这枚硬币
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.79,1:51:30.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,一
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.77,1:51:33.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了  埃里克
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.50,1:51:42.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,二
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.60,1:51:50.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,三
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.80,1:52:22.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏联和我们想法一致
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.89,1:52:25.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,联合向变种人发动袭击
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.84,1:52:27.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们就能永远结束这种威胁
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.11,1:52:29.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,良机不可错过
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.05,1:52:31.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有个特工还在海滩上
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.99,1:52:35.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一个特工  - 她是个优秀的特工
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.37,1:52:36.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,她是附带损害
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.23,1:52:45.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天我们的斗争结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.61,1:53:12.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看清楚吧  兄弟姐妹们
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.83,1:53:14.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,真正的敌人在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.57,1:53:18.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我感到他们的枪在水中移动
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.08,1:53:21.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们的大炮瞄准我们
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.60,1:53:25.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,美国人  苏联人  全人类
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.55,1:53:28.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为他们对未知的恐惧联合起来
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.06,1:53:33.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,尼安得特人害怕了  我的变异同胞们
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.11,1:53:37.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,继续  查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.65,1:53:41.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我我错了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.30,1:54:04.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰队指挥官  我是XB70小组
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.32,1:54:05.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,请回答  结束
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.79,1:54:09.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,海滩安全  请求取消攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.45,1:54:11.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,瞄准就位  预备射击  长官
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.06,1:54:13.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 待命  - 待命  长官
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.30,1:54:22.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂  喂
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.66,1:54:32.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,开火  开火
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.78,1:55:23.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克你说过我们都是更好的人
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.62,1:55:26.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在是证明它的时候了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.06,1:55:32.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些船上有上千个人
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.13,1:55:33.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是服从命令  无辜的人
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.52,1:55:36.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们只是服从命令
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.45,1:55:40.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我曾经对服从命令的人仁慈过
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.58,1:55:47.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会再有第二次了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.61,1:55:53.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克 放了他们
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.81,1:56:01.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.61,1:56:10.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不想伤害你 别逼我
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.81,1:56:11.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,别过来!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.01,1:56:22.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃里克  住手
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.69,1:56:34.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,先生们  和你们共事很骄傲
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.21,1:57:26.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.44,1:57:28.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说了往后退
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.05,1:57:32.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你  你干的
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.80,1:57:38.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.19,1:57:44.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是她  埃里克  是你干的
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.71,1:57:56.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们想要我们反目成仇
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.79,1:57:58.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我警告过你  查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.41,1:58:05.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你在我这一边  你我是兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.28,1:58:09.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们所有人在一起  彼此保护
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.45,1:58:13.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,兄弟齐心
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.07,1:58:15.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.75,1:58:19.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,很抱歉  我们不是
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.32,1:58:40.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,查尔斯  我很抱歉  真的抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.14,1:58:42.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,没关系  没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.13,1:58:48.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的社会不接纳我们
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.66,1:58:51.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们组建个社会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.53,1:58:53.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,人类耍花招
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.07,1:58:57.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们奉陪
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.20,1:59:02.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁和我一起
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.02,1:59:15.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要再隐藏了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.92,1:59:46.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你应该和他走  那才是你想要的
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.24,1:59:49.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你答应过我绝不读我的思想的
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.86,1:59:50.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.40,1:59:53.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我答应过你很多事  恐怕
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.77,1:59:55.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.39,2:00:02.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,好好照顾他
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.09,2:00:20.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,野兽  别忘了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.96,2:00:24.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,变异  骄傲
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.64,2:00:34.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,帮帮我  扶住他
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.05,2:00:37.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要把你送到医院
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.05,2:00:41.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等  查尔斯  别动  好吗
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.46,2:00:46.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧  实际上  我
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.37,2:00:50.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我感觉不到我的腿了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.86,2:00:53.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我感觉不到我的腿了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.40,2:00:57.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我感觉不到我的腿了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.16,2:01:10.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这个感恩节
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.80,2:01:12.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有许多需要感激的东西
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.84,2:01:16.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,回顾过去这四个星期我们的处境
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.42,2:01:19.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,北半球的联合  盟友的支持
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.90,2:01:22.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有美国人民冷静的判断
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.86,2:01:25.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些品质在近十年内
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.83,2:01:27.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,多次被检验
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.84,2:01:32.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说这里一旦开始办学校
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.65,2:01:34.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会有多少学生呢
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.00,2:01:38.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能管住就行  最好更多
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.82,2:01:42.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,要知道  终于一天政府会
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.76,2:01:46.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,意识到他们有多幸运
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.34,2:01:48.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,X教授站在他们这边
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.30,2:01:49.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.01,2:01:52.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要去当教授了  对吧
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.38,2:01:54.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,首先我会变成光头
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.67,2:01:57.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们仍站在政府那边  莫伊洛
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.57,2:02:01.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们仍然是政府的人  只是没有名号
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.63,2:02:04.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,不  你们有自己的队伍
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.26,2:02:06.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,这更好
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.46,2:02:09.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是X战警
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.43,2:02:13.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊  听上去不错
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.40,2:02:20.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,莫伊洛  隐姓埋名是我们第一道防线
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.75,2:02:21.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.41,2:02:26.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,查尔斯  他们什么时候威胁我
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.04,2:02:29.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我都不会告诉他们你在哪的
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.88,2:02:31.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,绝不
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.93,2:02:34.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你不会
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.40,2:02:37.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.13,2:02:47.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我记得那次袭击
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.97,2:02:49.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,之后去了一个地方
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.38,2:02:53.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,再然后今早上  我在家醒了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.50,2:02:55.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.71,2:02:59.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些记忆全从你大脑里清除了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.26,2:03:00.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.82,2:03:02.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,他能这么做  你什么都不记得了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.46,2:03:05.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,偶尔闪现一些片段
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.89,2:03:11.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,比如大树  阳光
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.42,2:03:15.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一个吻  - 哦上帝
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.55,2:03:19.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,先生们  这就是为什么中情局不要女性
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.97,2:03:26.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,那边怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.04,2:03:45.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道我们之间有分歧
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.94,2:03:51.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你心灵感应的朋友呢  - 走了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.86,2:03:55.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,老实说  在我在心里留了一道坎
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.86,2:03:57.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望你能填平它
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.24,2:04:04.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,加入我们吧
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.79,2:04:13.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是埃里克吧
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.98,2:04:18.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我更喜欢被称为
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.57,2:04:21.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,万磁王
